<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Tsishingini (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">2 Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="mt2">2 Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="ip">A ca ucuɗuwu wu za na ɗanai aatagada a nda shi. Amma uka̱lyusa̱ u roco ta̱ a ɗana yi ta̱ a cina a'wan a na a rawai ukpakukupa kucci na̱ mata'atsu (930) na ka̱ra̱i kafu a matsan Yesu, a̱ca̱pa̱ o tsugono tsa̱ Da̱wuda ke'en.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aatagada a̱ ire a Sama'ila u ca ta̱ alabari e ili i na i farasai a̱tsuma̱ a a'wan amunga o tsugono tsa̱ Da̱wuda. Alabari'i u ɓolo ta̱ na̱ von von nu ulyuwu wa aci a na Da̱wuda yuwain. Aatagada'a u lyuwa ta̱ e elime nu ucasu wa alabari o ukatalasa u Da̱wuda mogono ma aza a Yahuda 1:1-4:12, na̱ za na a katala niyi mogono ma aza a Isra'ila suru 5:1-24:25.</para>
  <para style="ip">A mantsa ma na Da̱wuda lyuwai Urishelima nu uvon, reve u ka̱mba̱to lyuci gbai'in iɗa ya Isra'ila. Reve waru u ta̱wa̱to Akpati a Nzuwulai ma̱ A̱sula̱ u zuwai lo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aatagada'a wi isawan lo e ekere o ulyuwu wa aci a̱ Da̱wuda goon shi, amma u lyuwa ta̱ elime a casu alabari a addama a na a cinasai Da̱wuda, aza a na a farai adama o unusu u na u yuwain na̱ Bashaba ka va Uriya, oɓolo na̱ u'ya̱susa̱n wa aci a na ulobo wa̱ yi Absalom yuwaan niyi 15:1-18:18.</para>
  <para style="ip">A̱ba̱jini e ili i na aatagada a nda a̱ ri pe a̱yi ɗa adama a wuma u mogono Da̱wuda. Ko na wo o'woi Da̱wuda mogono ma ɗa, a matsan ma na u yuwain unusu biti, u tsu jika̱ ta̱ u vadalashi a̱vu waru usu oforo a̱ A̱sula̱. Aatagada a̱ ire a Sama'ila u roco ta̱ suru nu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ Da̱wuda, A̱sula̱ a 'yuwan a na woo shiton nzuwulai n na u yuwain na ama a̱ yi shi.</para>
  <para style="is">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsugono tsa̱ Da̱wuda a aciya a aza a Yahuda 1:1-4:12</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsugono tsa̱ Da̱wuda a aciya a aza a Isra'ila suru 5:1-24:25</para>
  <para style="io2">a. A'wan o ufaru o tsugono 5:1-10:19</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Da̱wuda na̱ Bashaba 11:1-12:25</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Addama na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ Da̱wuda 12:26-20:26</para>
  <para style="io2">d. A'wan a na a̱ ka̱ra̱i o tsugono tsa̱ Da̱wuda 21:1-24:25.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda uwwa ta̱ alabari o ukwa̱ wa Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Apa ili i na i farai a mantsa ma na mogono Shawulu kuwa̱i. Reve Da̱wuda na ama a̱ yi a lyuwa ama a Amaleka nu uvon, a̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱ Ziklag, a̱vu a̱ da̱nu ɗe hali rana re. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />O urana wa taꞌatsu, a̱vu vuma ro ta̱wa̱ diga o uva̱la̱ta̱ wu uvon wa Shawulu, itana ya̱ yi wukaru waru na̱ ma̱buta̱ a aaci a̱ yi. Ana u rawai uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda, a̱vu u kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi e iɗa.<verse eid="2SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />A̱vu Da̱wuda ece yi u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱ te ɗa vu uta̱i?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;N la'a ta̱ diga o uva̱la̱ta̱ wu uvon wa aza a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />A̱vu Da̱wuda ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i farai? Damma mu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Reve vuma'a u usu yi, &lt;&lt;A̱soja a suma ta̱ diga uba̱ta̱ wu uvon, waru na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱. Shawulu nu ulobo wa̱ yi Jonata fo a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Reve Da̱wuda damma ulobo u na u ta̱wa̱a̱ niyi nu udammu'u, &lt;&lt;Cine tsa ɗa vu revei a na Shawulu nu ulobo wa̱ yi Jonata a̱ kuwa̱i?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Reve ulobo'o u usu, &lt;&lt;N shi ta̱ n tsura̱ n kumba ɗe a Masasan ma Gilbowa, reve me ene zagbain Shawulu ugbasatowu e ibata ya̱ yi, ikeke yi ido yu uvon na akumbi e ido yi n'yuwatan n da̱na̱ ta̱ a rawusa zuzu na̱ a̱yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6-10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 31:1-6; 1 Alb 10:1-6.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Ana u vadaluwai we ene numu, reve u salaa mu, a̱vu n damma, &lt;Mpa mu.&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />&lt;&lt;Reve we ece mu, &lt;A̱vu ɗa zane?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:8">&lt;&lt;Reve n usu yi, &lt;A̱mu za va Amaleka ɗa.&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />&lt;&lt;Reve u damma mu, &lt;Rawa zuzu na̱ a̱mu vu yuwan ankuri vu una mu! Adama a na n ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon, agba m buwa ta̱ e ivuwusan.&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />&lt;&lt;Ɗaɗa n rawai zuzu na̱ a̱yi a̱vu mu una yi, adama a na n reve ta̱ mantsa ma na u riya̱i waa la'a shi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Ngo 11:12.</char></note> N foɗo ta̱ okokolo a na a̱ ri a aaci a̱ yi, waru n foɗo ta̱ shingi vu ukere wa̱ yi, a̱vu n ta̱wa̱ ne ele pa nda uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu zagbain va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />A̱vu Da̱wuda reme itana ya̱ yi reve wu kara le, ne ɗa ama a na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱yi fo suru a yuwain. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />A̱vu a yuwan nden n wiruta̱ na̱ mesun na akuli hali ulivu adama a Shawulu na̱ Jonata ulobo wa̱ yi, na adama a̱ a̱soja a̱ A̱sulazuva, na adama o u'wa wa Isra'ila, adama a na o una le ta̱ na̱ matsun me pe'eni.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Da̱wuda ece ta̱ ulobo u na u ta̱wa̱a̱ niyi nu udammu'u, &lt;&lt;Te ɗa vu uta̱i?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Reve u usu, &lt;&lt;A̱mu mawun ma mocin ro ma ɗa, na ri na̱ nden e iɗa i ɗu za va Amaleka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Reve Da̱wuda ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i zuwai vu uwwai wovon u na va̱a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ukere wa̱ wu vu unai vuma na A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱yin mani'in shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda ɗeyi vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a ali o uvon a̱ yi a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu una yi!&gt;&gt; A̱vu u ga̱la̱ yi hali u kuwa̱. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Reve Da̱wuda damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ume wu mpasa ma̱ wu u ta a aaci a̱ wu. Adama a na nu una̱ wa̱ wu u ɗa vu dammai, &lt;A̱mu ɗa mu unai za na A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱yin mani'in.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda yuwan ta̱ nden n wirota̱ adama a Shawulu na̱ Jonata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Reve Da̱wuda cana ishipa ya̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu adama a Shawulu nu ulobo wa̱ yi Jonata. <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Reve u zuwa o rito ama a Yahuda ishipa ya̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu'u yu utan. A ɗana yi ta̱ a Aatagada a Yasha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Jos 10:13.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />&lt;&lt;Tsugbain tsa̱ wu, a̱vu Isra'ila, o una ta̱ azagbain a̱ wu zuva masasan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">Ama o ucira a̱ wu a̱ riya̱ ta̱!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />She a ca udammu ɗe lyuci va Gat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">ko e re va Ashikelon wan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">ta̱wa̱ esheli a Filistiya a yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ wan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">she esheli a aza a na a paɗai uryumbu shi a yuwan mere wan.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />&lt;&lt;A̱ɗu nsasan ma̱ Gilbowa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">she i da̱shi tsura̱ a'iza ko iro'i wan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">ko a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ɗu a matsan ishina adama o ucasu wan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Adama a na ɗe ɗa a̱ lungusa̱i a̱a̱ra̱ga̱ a̱ a̱za̱ o ucira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">a buwa a̱ da̱shi sukuma a̱a̱ra̱ga̱ a Shawulu mani'in shi.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />&lt;&lt;Diga a mpasa ma aza a na a paɗai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">diga a̱ lipu va̱ a̱za̱ o ucira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">utan wa Jonata u ka̱mba̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">matsun me pe'eni ma Shawulu ma̱ ka̱mba̱ lya̱nga̱ shi.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Shawulu na̱ Jonata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">a wuma a ciga le ta̱, waru o roco le ta̱ isa'ani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">waru o ukwisa̱ a kasa shi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">A la'a ta̱ a̱a̱kuru ilaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">waru a la'a ta̱ ikamu ucira.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />&lt;&lt;A̱ɗu esheli a Isra'ila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">shoyin adama a Shawulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">za na yuwaan ɗu itana i shili yi ikebe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">za na yuwayin itana i ɗu yikalishi i zinariya.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />&lt;&lt;Ama o ucira a̱ riya̱ ta̱!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Jonata ta̱ nven ukwa̱ ɗe zuva masasan ma̱ wu.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />U ɓa̱li mu ta̱ lon adama a̱ wu, mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ va̱ Jonata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">vu da̱na̱ ta̱ zuzu na̱ a̱mu lon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Icigi ya̱ wu e ekere a̱ va̱ u da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱bunda̱ lon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">u la'a ta̱ icigi yi ka.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />&lt;&lt;Ama o ucira a̱ riya̱ ta̱!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">Itana yu uvon i le waru i la̱nga̱ ta̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">A̱ tsuwa̱n ta̱ Da̱wuda mani'i wo o'wo mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi, Da̱wuda ece ta̱ A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;N ka̱ra̱ a gawan a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci ta̱ vi ilyuci ya Yahuda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Reve A̱sulazuva a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Gawan a̱ 'ya̱wa̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Reve we ecishe, &lt;&lt;A zane mee tyo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Heburon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda ka̱ra̱i a gawan ɗe na̱ a̱ma̱ci e re a̱ yi, Ahinowam va Yezireyel, oɓolo na̱ Abigel ma̱runa̱ ma Nabal va Kame. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Waru Da̱wuda tara ta̱ ali a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, za suru nu u'wa wa̱ yi, reve a̱ va̱la̱ a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci zuzu na̱ Heburon. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Reve ama a Yahuda a̱ ta̱wa̱ ɗe Heburon, reve a̱ tsuwa̱n Da̱wuda mani'in wo o'wo mogono ma aza a Yahuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Ana Da̱wuda uwwai a na ama a Jabe Giliyadu a ɗa a̱ ciɗoi Shawulu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 31:11-13.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />a̱vu u lyunguwa̱ ama a Jabe Giliyadu nlingata a damma le, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva a zuwaa ɗu aba'un adama a na i roco ta̱ Shawulu zagbain ɗu icigi ni isa'ani ana i ciɗo niyi. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Gogo lyawa A̱sulazuva o roco ɗu icigi ni isa'ani na̱ a̱ɓula̱. Waru a̱mu fo n ta yuwaan ɗu isa'ani adama a na i yuwain ili i nda. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Gogo yi isawan nu ucira i yuwan ukadu, adama a na Shawulu zagbain ɗu kuwa̱i, a̱vu u'wa wa Yahuda u tsuwa̱n mu mani'in mo o'wo mogono a aci e le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishboshe o'wo ta̱ mogono ma Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Amma Abna ulobo wa Ner, yali ya̱ a̱soja a Shawulu, u tara ta̱ Ishboshe ulobo wa Shawulu a̱vu u pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu na̱ a̱yi a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci va Mahanayim. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Reve u zuwa yi wo o'wo mogono mo upasu wa Giliyadu, na aza a Ashuri nu upasu wa Yezireyel na̱ Ifiramu na̱ Banyami, mogono ma aza a Isra'ila suru.<verse eid="2SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishboshe ulobo wa Shawulu da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan amunga ana wo o'woi mogono ma Isra'ila, waru u yuwan ta̱ tsugono a'wan e re. Agba ugundo wa Yahuda u yuwan ta̱ tsutoni na̱ Da̱wuda. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Da̱wuda yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsu ugundo wa Yahuda a̱tsuma̱ a Heburon a'wan e cindere na̱ woto ta̱li.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uvon wa Isra'ila na̱ Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Urana u ro Abna ulobo wa Ner, oɓolo na ali o uvon a Ishboshe ulobo wa Shawulu, a lyawa ta̱ Mahanayim a̱vu a̱ tyo Gibiyon. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />A̱vu Yowab za na mma va̱ yi ɗa Zeruya oɓolo na ali o uvon a̱ Da̱wuda o uta̱ a̱vu a cina le oko'o a gbain a Gibiyon. Reve oɓolo a̱ ta̱ a̱ da̱nu upasu u ta̱ wo oko'o'o, a̱vu oɓolo a̱ ta̱ a̱ da̱nu upasu u ta̱ wo oko'o'o a na a buwai.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Ɗaɗa Abna canana yi Yowab una̱ u damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa olobo a̱ 'yon a yuwan nla̱ngi elime a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Reve Yowab damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa le a yuwan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Reve a̱ 'yon reve e kece ama kupa ne ejere adama o upasu wa Banyami a na o rono ama a Ishboshe ulobo wa Shawulu aɗanga, kupa ne ejere waru o una̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />A̱vu koyan reme moron ma̱ nla̱ngi ma̱ yi aaci, reve a sapalai na̱ matsun me pe'eni e eeɓele a̱ ta̱. Ne ɗa a̱ riya̱i ele ra reve a̱ kuwa̱. Adama o ndolo a ɗa a cayi uba̱ta̱'a̱ aala <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urevu wi idanshi'i na̱ Tsuyahuda a̱yi ɗa &lt;&lt;Uba̱ta̱ u matsun me pe'eni.&gt;&gt;</char></note>Helka Hazurim, za na ri a̱tsuma̱ a Gibiyon.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Reve e teme uvon wu usuɗuwu urana'a, reve ama a̱ Da̱wuda a lyuwa Abna na ama a Isra'ila nu uvon.<verse eid="2SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Olobo a ta'atsu a ka ndolo Zeruya a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ ɗe, ele ɗa Yowab na̱ Abishai oɓolo na̱ Asahe. Agba Asahel gura ta̱ ilaɗi lon tsa̱ mere'on ma atsusa. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />A̱vu u gbagba Abna ni ilaɗi o tono yi agba u vadala usa'ani ko ugula̱ shi. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Ana Abna vadaluwai a̱vu we ece, &lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗaɗa, Asahe shi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">A̱vu u usu yi, &lt;&lt;Ee a̱mu ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Reve Abna damma yi, &lt;&lt;Lyawa magbagba ma̱ va̱ a̱vu vu vadala ukere usa'ani ko ugula̱ wa̱ wu, a̱vu vu reme ulobo u ta̱ reve vu usa yi itana yu uvon.&gt;&gt; Amma Asahe lyawa magbagba ma̱ yi shi.<verse eid="2SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Reve Abna da̱shi ɓarisa Asahe, &lt;&lt;Lyawa a gbagbusa mu! She vu zuwa mu mu una wu wan. Nna̱ ne ɗa shi cine tsa ɗa maa gura ka̱lyuwa̱ urewesu u mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ wu Yowab?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Amma Asahel lyawa o tono yi shi, a̱vu Abna sapa yi a̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ nu ugundo wi ibata ya̱ yi hali ibata'a yu uta̱la̱i nu ucina̱. Reve Asahe riya̱ lo a̱vu u kuwa̱ uba̱ta̱ u na u shi. Reve za na suru ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ u na Asahel riya̱i a̱vu u kuwa̱, u tsi isawan ta̱ kuci kuci.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Amma a̱vu Yowab na̱ Abishai a saɓa Abna. Urana a̱ ma̱riya̱a̱ reve a rawa a aagaɗi a Amma, za na ri elime a Giya o ure a̱ tyo A̱tsumona a Gibiyon. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />A̱vu ama o ugundo wa Banyami o ɓolo aciyele a̱ kuru Abna a̱vu o o'wo oɓolo a̱ ta̱, reve e isawan zuva va aagaɗi.<verse eid="2SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Ɗaɗa Abna ɗeyi Yowab a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Matsun me pe'eni ma ta lyuwa elime na̱ mona babu ukotu? Vu reve a na ukosu woo o'wo okono shi? Mantsa ma̱ ne ma ɗa vaa damma ali a̱ wu a lyawa a saɓusa a̱za̱ e le aza a Isra'ila?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Reve Yowab usu yi, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ na̱ A̱sula̱ a na a̱ ri wuma, na̱ vu shi vu yuwan adanshi shi, tsa̱ shi ta̱ a lyuwa elime na̱ magbagba ma̱ ɗu hali she usana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Reve Yowab ivula̱ aavana, a̱vu oɓolo a ali'i suru e isawan, a̱ da̱shi gbagba aza a Isra'ila shi. Waru babu za na da̱shi yuwisain uvon.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />A̱vu Abna na ama a̱yi a̱ kuru a̱ tyo o Uka̱ri wa Araba ayin ma̱ɓula̱. Reve a pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu, a̱vu e teme mmalu diga usana acina urana aci hali she na a rawai Mahanayim.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Ana Yowab lyawai magbagba ma Abna, ɗaɗa u ɓolotoi ali o uvon a̱yi suru u kece le. Babu na̱ Asahe, a lamba ta̱ ali a̱ Da̱wuda kupa na̱ kucci. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Amma ali a̱ Da̱wuda o una ta̱ ama ukpakuta'atsu na̱ kupota̱li (360) a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa Banyami aza na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ Abna. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />A̱vu Yowab oɓolo na ali o uvon a̱ yi a tara lipu va Asahe reve a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ ciɗo yi a aason a dada va̱ yi ɗe Batalami. A̱vu Yowab na ali a̱ yi a yuwan mmalu ayin ma̱ɓula̱, a̱vu a rawa Heburon nu usana.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />U'wa wa Shawulu nu u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda a jima ta̱ a yuwusan uvon. U'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda u da̱shishi ta̱ ucira amma u'wa wa Shawulu u jibusa ta̱ ucira.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olobo a na a matsayin Da̱wuda a Heburon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 3:1-4">1 Alb 3:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />A matsaan ta̱ Da̱wuda muwun mo olobo a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Heburon. Aala o ulobo wu ufaru wa̱ yi a̱yi ɗa Amnon ulobo wa Ahinowam va Yezireyel. <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Za ve ire a̱yi ɗa Kileyab ulobo wa Abigel ma̱runa̱ ma Nabal za va Kame. Za va ta'atsu a̱yi ɗa Absalom ulobo wa Ma'aka usheli wa Talmai mogono ma̱ Geshu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱ 2 Sam 13:37.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Za va̱ na̱shi a̱yi ɗa Adonija ulobo wa Hagit. Ulobo wa tawun waru a̱yi ɗa Shefatiya ulobo wa Abital. <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />Za va̱ ta̱li a̱yi ɗa Itireyam za na Egila matsaan niyi. Ele nda ɗa a matsayin Da̱wuda ɗe Heburon.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abna vadala ta̱ u ɓolo e ekere na̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Mantsa ma na uvon u da̱na̱i a lyuwusa elime e ekere o u'wa wa Shawulu nu u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda, tsugbain tsa Abna tsa̱ da̱shishi ta̱ ucira o u'wa wa Shawulu. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Shawulu da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ ka vu nge'en ro za na a̱ tsu ɗe Rizfa usheli wa A'iya. A̱vu Ishboshe ece Abna, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu voyin na̱ ka vu nge'en va dada va̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />A̱vu Abna yuwan upan lon adama a adanshi a na Ishboshe damma niyi reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Vu ta a majiyan a̱mu musa̱n ma ɗa ma na maa yuwusaan aza a Yahuda ulinga? Diga ɗe acina ana'an n to rocosu u'wa wa Shawulu dada va̱ wu icigi ya amayun, na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi, oɓolo na̱ n'utsa̱ ma̱ yi. Agba n ca ɗu e ekere a̱ Da̱wuda shi. Amma na̱ ne suru a̱vu ve ene unusu u va̱ adama a ka nda! <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Lyawa A̱sula̱ a ca mu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon, nna̱ n kamba Da̱wuda tsura̱ ili i na A̱sulazuva a taraa niyi akucunu shi. <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱, u ta tara tsugono diga o u'wa wa Shawulu a̱vu u shuwa̱ ootogu o tsugono tsa̱ Da̱wuda a aci a Isra'ila na̱ e ekere a Yahuda, diga upasu wu ugana u lyuci va Dan a̱ tyo upasu wu uyagi u lyuci va Biyasheba.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9-10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 15:28. </char></note> <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Agba Ishboshe kawan damma ili i ro waru shi, adama a na u ta uwwusa wovon wa Abna.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Reve Abna lyungu nlingata o una̱ wa̱ yi a damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Iɗa ya zane i ɗa? Yuwaan mu nzuwulai, a̱mu waru n ta kamba wu, n zuwa aza a Isra'ila suru a̱ kuru wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Reve Da̱wuda damma, &lt;&lt;U lobono ta̱! N ta yuwan nzuwulai na̱ a̱vu. Amma n ta pati wu ili i ta̱. She vu ta̱wa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱ wan she na̱ va̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ Mikal, usheli wa Shawulu mantsa ma na va̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />A̱vu Da̱wuda lyunguwa̱ Ishboshe nlingata, ulobo wa Shawulu, adansa, &lt;&lt;Ca mu ka va̱ Mikal, za na n tsupai ili i tsutoto na̱ kwan vu ryumbu ukpaku (100) va aza a Filistiya.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14-16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 25:44.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Reve Ishboshe lyungu a tara Mikal diga uba̱ta̱ u vali va̱ yi Palti ulobo wa Layish. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Amma vali va̱ yi kuru yi ta̱ ucina̱, e mesun hali a̱ tyo lyuci va Bahurim. A̱vu Abna damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mba̱ o u'wa!&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa gba u ka̱mba̱i o u'wa.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abna shi ta̱ ɗe yuwan adanshi na̱ mbara ma Isra'ila, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;A na wo o'woi ɗe i zamishi ta̱ Da̱wuda o'wo mogono ma̱ ɗu, <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />gogo she i yuwan ne! Adama a na A̱sulazuva a yuwaan ta̱ Da̱wuda nzuwulai, u damma, &lt;E ekere a aagbashi a̱ va̱ Da̱wuda a ɗa maa wawa ama a̱ va̱ aza a Isra'ila diga e ekere a aza a Filistiya na̱ diga e ekere a akapi a n'yuwatan n le suru.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abna yuwan ta̱ waru adanshi na ama o ugundo wa Banyami. Reve u 'ya̱wa̱ Heburon u damma Da̱wuda ili i na suru ugundo wa Banyami na akapi a ama a Isra'ila suru a cigai a yuwan. <verse eid="2SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Ana Abna ta̱wa̱i na ali ushin a̱tsuma̱ a ali a̱ yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda ɗe Heburon, Da̱wuda foɓo ta̱ a̱buki adama a Abna na ali a̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Reve Abna damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Lyawa mu n ka̱ra̱ m ɓolotowo zagbain va̱ mogono aza a Isra'ila suru, adama a yuwan akucunu na̱ a̱vu vo o'wo mogono ma̱ le, waru vu yuwan tsugono tsu uba̱ta̱ u na okolo a̱ wu a cigai suru.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda lyawai Abna ka̱ra̱i na asuvu nden.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yowab una ta̱ Abna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Reve gba ali o uvon a̱ Da̱wuda a rawushi oɓolo na̱ Yowab diga uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ riya̱yi nu uvon, a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ni itana ya̱ a̱bunda̱ aza a na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ o uvon. Amma Abna da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ Da̱wuda ɗe Heburon shi, adama a na Da̱wuda lyawa yi ta̱ ɗe u ka̱ra̱, waru u ka̱ra̱ ta̱ na asuvu nden. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Ana Yowab oɓolo na̱ a̱soja a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi suru a rawai, avu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Abna ulobo wa Ner ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ɗe uba̱ta̱ u mogono, waru mogono ma lyawa yi ta̱ ɗe, a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ na asuvu nden.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Reve Yowab 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa vu yuwain tsunda? Ka̱lyuwa̱, a̱yi ɗa nda, Abna ta̱wa̱i ya̱'a̱ wu. Nye i zuwai vu lyawa niyi u la'ai? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Vu reve ta̱ Abna ulobo wa Ner ta̱wa̱ ta̱ wu luma̱ wu, tsa̱ra̱ u reve wutu wa̱ wu nu uka̱mbu wa̱ wu, waru u reve ili i na vaa yuwusan suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Ana Yowab uta̱i diga a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ Da̱wuda, reve u lyungu nlingata a̱ kuru ucina̱ wa Abna, a̱vu a cina yi ooko'o a Sira reve a̱ ka̱mba̱ na̱ yi. Amma Da̱wuda reve aɗa a nda shi. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Ana Abna ka̱mba̱i Heburon, Yowab tara yi ta̱ a̱ tyo e memere mo una̱ntsu wu uwata u lyuci, ngashi u ciga ta̱ u yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱yi a̱ nde'en, lo ɗa u sapa niyi a̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ hali u kuwa̱, adama u tsupaa mpasa m mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi Asahe.<verse eid="2SA 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ a na Da̱wuda uwwai adama a nda, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱mu na̱ tsugono tsa va̱ tsu ri nu unusu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva adama a mpasa ma Abna ulobo wa̱ Ner shi hali hali. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Lyawa mpasa ma Abna n da̱na̱ a aci a̱ Yowab nu u'wa wa dada va̱ yi suru! Lyawa u'wa wa̱ Yowab u lamba za na a̱ ɗa̱wusa̱ lipu wan ko za na ri na̱ mɓa̱la̱ mu ukwan u lipu wan ko za na tsu wala na aaɗanga shi ko za na o una na̱ matsun me pe'eni ko a yuwan ambulu shi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Ne ɗa Yowab na̱ mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi Abishai o unai Abna, adama a na wu una ta̱ zawa'a le Asahe uba̱ta̱ o uvon u na a yuwain ɗe Gibiyon.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda yuwan ta̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu adama a Abna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma Yowab na ama a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi suru, &lt;&lt;Kakarai a̱tugu a̱ ɗu, reve yo oto akashamuna a̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu a̱vu i yuwan nden n wirota̱ elime a Abna.&gt;&gt; Mogono Da̱wuda kuru ta̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ a aza a na a tanuyi lipuꞌu. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Reve a̱ ciɗo Abna a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Heburon, a̱vu mogono mo oruwo u sala lon a aason a Abna. Ama'a suru fo a̱ shon ta̱.<verse eid="2SA 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Reve mogono ma canaa Abna ishipa ya̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, u damma,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:33" />
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">&lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai Abna kuwa̱i cine olo a̱ tsu kuwa̱?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Ekere a̱ wu a̱ shi wunlu shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">ana a̱ wu waru a̱ da̱na̱ wunlu na akani shi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Tsu za na aza awuya o unai.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:34" />
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 3:34">A̱vu ama'a suru a̱ da̱shi shon adama a̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Reve ama'a suru a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda a damaton yi adama u lyuwa ilyalya babu na urana u kotoi. Amma Da̱wuda kucina ta̱ a dansa, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sula̱ a ca mu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon, na̱ n peɗe ilyalya ko ili i ro babu na urana u riya̱i!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />A̱vu ama'a suru e petelyuwe ili'i, reve a uwwa uyo'o ni ili i na mogono ma yuwain suru, ama'a a uwwa ta̱ uyo'o wa̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Adama o ndolo o urana u ɗaɗa oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a̱ Da̱wuda na aza a Isra'ila suru e revei a na mogono ma̱ ri pe nu ukere a̱ mona ma Abna ulobo wa Ner shi.<verse eid="2SA 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />A̱vu mogono ma damma ali a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;I reve a na yali i gbain i ɗa kuwa̱i ana'an a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila shi? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Waru ana'an nda ko na wo o'woi a̱mu ɗa mogono ma na a̱ tsuwa̱yin mani'in, mo o'wo ta̱ babu ucira, olobo a Zeruya a la'a mu ta̱ ucira. Lyawa A̱sulazuva a tsupa za vi iwuya ni iwuya i na u yuwain!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">O una ta̱ Ishboshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ana Ishboshe ulobo wa Shawulu wu uwwai Abna kuwa̱ ta̱ a Heburon, a̱vu okolo a̱ yi a kuɗa, ɗaɗa fo wovon u remei aza a Isra'ila suru. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Ishboshe da̱na̱ ta̱ na azagbain e re aza a na ele ɗa nan yali ya̱ a̱soja a na a̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ riya̱a̱ ilyuci yi n'yuwatan nu uvon. Aala a za ta̱ a̱yi ɗa Ba'ana za ve ire waru a̱yi ɗa Rekab, ele olobo a Rimon vuma va Biyaro diga o ugundo wa Banyami ɗa. Adama a na e kece ta̱ lyuci va Biyaro a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wi iɗa ya Banyami, <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />adama a na aza a Biyaro a suma ta̱ a̱ tyo Gitayim, uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ri a̱ nden n tsumocin hali na ana'an.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Jonata ulobo wa Shawulu u da̱na̱ ta̱ nu ulobo za na da̱na̱i na aala Mefiboshe za na da̱na̱i a̱a̱kutsuma̱. U da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan o ton nu umatsun a na wu uwwai aɗa o ukwa̱ wa Shawulu na̱ Jonata diga o una̱ wa Yezireyel, a̱vu za na o goloɓuso yi sheɗe yi a̱vu u suma na̱ a̱yi. A̱yi a̱tsuma̱ e ilaɗi, a̱vu ulobo'o u riya̱ ɗaɗa u kutsuma̱i.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 9:3.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Urana u ro a̱vu Rekab na̱ Ba'ana olobo a Rimon vuma va Biyaro, e reme ure a̱ tyo o u'wa wa Ishboshe, a̱vu a rawa ɗe nu urana a aci, a̱yi nven a̱ a̱a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ yi e ivuwusan. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6-7" />Ana a uwai hali a̱ tyo a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa'a uba̱ta̱ u na u da̱na̱i nven a aasula a̱ a̱a̱ga̱da̱ a̱yi, a̱vu a yuwan ngashi a ciga ta̱ e kene yitabo, a̱vu a sapa yi a̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ o una yi reve o koɗo aaci a̱ yi a̱ ka̱ra̱ na̱ a̱yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 4:6-7">A̱vu a̱ kuru nu Uka̱ri wa Araba, ɗaɗa gba a asai a mmalu. <verse eid="2SA 4:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Reve a̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ mogono Da̱wuda na aaci a Ishboshe ɗe Heburon. A̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Nda aaci a Ishboshe, ulobo wa Shawulu, ma'yuwatan ma̱ wu, za na shi cigai u tara wuma wa̱ wu. A̱sulazuva a tsupaa ta̱ zagbain tsu mogono e ekere a Shawulu nu u'wa wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Amma Da̱wuda usu ta̱ Rekab na̱ mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi Ba'ana, olobo a Rimon vuma va Biyaro, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, za na wawa numu a̱tsuma̱ a addama a̱ va̱ suru! <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />Ana za ro damma numu, &lt;Shawulu kuwa̱ ta̱,&gt; a̱vu u yuwusan majiyan u ta̱wa̱a̱ mu ta̱ nu udammu u sa'ani, n reme yi ta̱ a̱vu n zuwa za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱soja una yi a Ziklag. Akunda a na n ca niyi ɗa ndolo adama o udammu wa̱ yi!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 1:1-16.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Cine woo o'wo e ekere a̱ a̱za̱ e iwuya a na o unai za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi waru a̱ a̱a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ yi? Gogo n ta tsupaa mpasa ma̱ yi e ekere a̱ ɗu, a̱vu n tawa ɗu o uvaɗi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />A̱vu Da̱wuda zuwa ali o uvon a̱ yi, ɗaɗa gba o una nle. A̱vu o koɗo ekere e le na ana e le a̱vu a̱ sa̱ga̱do lipu le zuva vu uɗanga zuzu no ooko'o a gbain a Heburon. Reve a tara aaci a Ishboshe reve a̱ ciɗo yi a aason a Abna a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Heburon.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda o'wo ta̱ mogono ma Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:1-3">1 Alb 11:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Gundo va Isra'ila suru a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Heburon reve a damma, &lt;&lt;A̱tsu lipu va̱ wu ɗa na̱ mpasa ma̱ wu. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Ɗe na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱, ana Shawulu yuwusain tsugono tsa̱ tsu, a̱vu ɗa za na ronusoi aza a Isra'ila aɗanga uba̱ta̱ o uvon. Waru A̱sulazuva a damma wu ta̱, &lt;A̱vu ɗa voo o'wo za va aguɓa va ama a̱ va̱ aza a Isra'ila, waru vu to o'wo le zagbain.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Ana mbara ma Isra'ila suru n ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ u mogono Da̱wuda a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Heburon, a̱vu u yuwan nzuwulai ne ele a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva ɗe Heburon, ɗaɗa a̱ tsuwa̱yin Da̱wuda mani'in wo o'wo mogono ma Isra'ila. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Da̱wuda da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan mata'atsu a na wo o'woi mogono, reve u yuwan tsugono aꞌwan amunga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4-5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Ngo 2:11; 1 Alb 3:4; 1 Alb 29:27.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />A̱tsuma̱ a̱ Heburon u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa Yahuda a'wan e cindere na̱ woto ta̱li, a̱vu fo u yuwan tsugono tsa Isra'ila suru na aza a Yahuda a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a'wan mata'atsu na aza a ta'atsu.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda lyuwa ta̱ Urishelima nu uvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:4-9">1 Alb 11:4-9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Mogono Da̱wuda oɓolo na ali o uvon a̱ yi a̱ tyo ta̱ Urishelima adama a̱ riya̱a̱ aza a Jebusiya a na a̱ da̱na̱i ɗe na̱ nden nu uvon. A̱vu aza a Jebusiya a damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Vaa uwa pa shi, ko nrumba̱ na̱ a̱kutsuma̱ a rawa ta̱ o lo wu.&gt;&gt; A jiyan ta̱, &lt;&lt;Da̱wuda aa gura uwa pa shi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Jos 15:63; A̱.Ug 1:21.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Ko na̱ ne, Da̱wuda lyuwa ta̱ lyuci na ri uka̱nda̱ruwu nu ukari wa̱ Sihiyona nu uvon, za na a̱ tsu ɗe gogo Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />O urana u ndolo, Da̱wuda damma ta̱ ali a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Za na suru cigai lyuwa aza a Jebusiya nu uvon u ciga u 'yuwan u kuru nu uyene u mini. Ne ɗa ya̱ riya̱a̱ &lt;nrumba̱ na̱ a̱kutsuma̱,&gt; a̱soja a na o o'woi n'yuwatan ma̱ Da̱wuda.&gt;&gt; A̱yi ɗa i zuwai a tsu damma, &lt;&lt;A̱kutsuma̱ na̱ nrumba̱ aa uwa o ukobu u mogono shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Da̱wuda gba lyuwa ta̱ lyuci vu uɓaɓu wu ucira reve u da̱nu pe, a̱vu u ca yi aala Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda. A̱vu u yuwisan yisuwishi u da̱shi uɓaɓu'u suru ucira a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱. U teme ta̱ diga upasu wa aagaɗi a alanga a uwa pe a̱tsuma̱. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />A̱vu Da̱wuda da̱shishi ucira lon, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Reve Hiram mogono ma Taya ma̱a̱ lyunguwa̱a̱ Da̱wuda nlingata, na akpata a ɗanga va sida, na̱ a̱za̱ o ulinga wa akpata, na̱ a̱za̱ o usaa na atali, a̱vu a suwaa Da̱wuda ukobu u tsugono. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />A̱vu Da̱wuda reve a na A̱sulazuva a ɗa a̱ shuwa̱i tsugono tsa̱ yi e ekere a aza a Isra'ila, waru u ca ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ yi tsugbain adama a ama a̱ yi aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Ana Da̱wuda lyawai Heburon u ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo Urishelima na̱ nden, u zuwisa ta̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱vu u tarisa a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en, a̱vu a̱ da̱shi matsaan yi muwun mo olobo ne esheli. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Nda ala o olobo a na a matsayin Da̱wuda ɗe Urishelima: Shamuwa na̱ Shoba na̱ Natan na̱ Sulemanu <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />na̱ Ibha na̱ Elishuwa na̱ Nefe na̱ Yafiya <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />na̱ Elishama na̱ Eliyada na̱ Elifele.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda lyuwa ta̱ aza a Filistiya nu uvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1 Alb 14:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Mantsa ma na aza a Filistiya a uwwai a na a̱ tsuwa̱a̱n ta̱ Da̱wuda mani'in wo o'wo mogono ma Isra'ila, a̱vu a̱soja a Filistiya suru o uta̱ a gawan nu ucira e izami ya̱ Da̱wuda. Agba a na Da̱wuda uwwai, a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci vu uɓaɓu wu ucira'a. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Aza a Filistiya gba a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ a baza aciyele o Uka̱ri wa aza a Refaya. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Reve Da̱wuda ece A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;N 'ya̱wa̱ n yuwan uvon na aza a Filistiya? Vu ta ca le o ukere u va̱?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱, n ta ca aza a Filistiya e ekere a̱ wu na amayun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />A̱vu Da̱wuda 'ya̱wa̱ Ba'al Ferazim, ɗe ɗa u lyuwai aci a aza a Filistiya. Reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Cine mini mo tsu ɓoso, ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o ɓosoi a aci a n'yuwatan n va̱ e esu a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt; Adama o ndolo a ɗa a̱ ɗeyi uba̱ta̱'a̱ Ba'al Perazim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ba'al Perazim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urevu wa aala a nda na̱ Tsuyahuda a̱yi ɗa &lt;&lt;Zagbain na tsu ɓoso.&gt;&gt; </char></note>. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />A̱vu aza a Filistiya a suma a lyawa a̱ma̱li e le, ɗaɗa Da̱wuda na ali a̱ yi a̱ pura̱ nle.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Reve aza a Filistiya a̱ da̱shi gawan a̱vu a baza o Uka̱ri wa aza a Refaya. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Reve Da̱wuda ece A̱sulazuva, reve u usu yi, &lt;&lt;She vu 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u le mejege wan, amma vu ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ le nu ucina̱ a̱vu vu riya̱a̱ le nu uvon elime a ɗanga vu jan. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Waru mantsa ma na vu uwwai ilama yi mmalu zuva ve eten vu ɗanga vu jan, a̱vu vu jika̱ mmalu, adama a na a̱yi ndolo u to rocosu A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ elime a̱ wu adama wu ga̱la̱ oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a aza a Filistiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Reve Da̱wuda yuwan cine A̱sulazuva a damma niyi, a̱vu wu ga̱la̱ aza a Filistiya diga Geba a̱ tyo Geza.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">A̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ na Akpati a Nzuwulai Urishelima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1 Alb 13:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:6">15:25-16:6,43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Da̱wuda da̱shi ta̱ ɓolotowiso ali o uvon a Isra'ila, ukpakukupa mata'atsu (30,000) a na u ɗangulai. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />A̱vu Da̱wuda 'yon u ka̱ra̱ oɓolo na ali a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi diga Ba'ala va Yahuda na a̱ tsu ɗe Kiriyat Jeyarim, adama u ta̱wa̱a̱ na Akpati a̱ A̱sula̱, za na a̱ tsu ɗe na aala A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, za na ri nden e memere me ikerobobi i na i ri zuva va Akpati'i. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Reve a zuwa Akpati a̱ A̱sula̱'a̱ e keke sa'avu vi inan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">keke sa'avu vi inan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Reve ama tanu Akpati a Nzuwulai A̱sula̱ zuva keke vi inan (Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 6:7). Amma a̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva u damma le ta̱ nan Levi ɗa goon a tanu yi na aɗanga le avangaci le.</char></note> reve a ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi diga o u'wa wa Abinada, za na ri a aagaɗi. <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />Oɓolo na Akpati a nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱, a̱vu Ahiyo wala elime. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Reve Da̱wuda nu u'wa wa aza a Isra'ila suru a yuwusan uje'en nu ucira u lipu u le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, avu a̱ da̱na̱ e ishipa na a wa'asai cu'un vi itana yi wa'ashi aza a na a yuwain na̱ ɗanga fir vi ikumburu ni igaraya na̱ muganga ni iwakacau na̱ mupalu m malapa.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Ana a rawai o osoroto a Nakon, reve ina'an a̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱, a̱vu Uza canana ukere wa̱ yi u reme Akpati a̱ A̱sula̱'a̱. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan na̱ Uza lon, adama o unusu o ndolo a ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ ga̱la̱ niyi a̱vu u kuwa̱ lo zuzu na Akpati a̱ A̱sula̱'a̱.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Alb 13:10.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Reve Da̱wuda yuwan upan adama a na upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ riya̱i a aci a Uza. Hali a cina ana'an a̱ tsu ɗe ta̱ uba̱ta̱'a̱ Pere Uza.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pere Uza </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urevu wa aala a nda na̱ Tsuyahuda a̱yi ɗa &lt;&lt;Upan u riya̱i a aci a Uza.&gt;&gt;</char></note><verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />A̱vu Da̱wuda uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva o urana u ndolo, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Cine tsa ɗa maa zuwa Akpati a̱ A̱sulazuva uba̱ta̱ u va̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Adama o ndolo Da̱wuda usu u tara Akpati a̱ A̱sulazuva oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a̱ tyo a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda shi. Amma a̱vu u tara yi a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ Obed Edom vuma va Gat. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Reve Akpati a̱ A̱sulazuva o o'wo o u'wa wa̱ Obed Edom vuma va Gat hali woto taꞌatsu, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a zuwaa Obed Edom aba'un oɓolo nu u'wa wa̱ yi suru.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Alb 26:4-5.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Reve a damma Da̱wuda mogono, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a zuwaa ta̱ u'wa wa̱ Obed Edom ni ili i na u ri na̱ a̱yi suru aba'un, adama a Akpati a̱ A̱sula̱.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda 'ya̱wa̱i u tarai Akpati a̱ A̱sula̱ diga o u'wa wa̱ Obed Edom a̱ tyo Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Mantsa ma na aza a na a tanuyi Akpati a̱ A̱sulazuva a yuwain udasuwu u ta̱li reve e isawan, ɗaɗa Da̱wuda cayi kucci vo ogono a nan na̱ ma̱dindim ma̱ lipu. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Da̱wuda wotowu na̱ ma̱tugu ma̱ epo vo okoro, reve u yuwan uje'en nu ucira wa̱ yi suru a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Ne ɗa Da̱wuda nu u'wa wa Isra'ila suru a̱ ta̱wa̱i na Akpati a̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ yisali i ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ wivulu wa avana.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Akpati a̱ A̱sulazuva a ma'uwaa a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda, reve Mikal usheli wa Shawulu, u ka̱lyuwa̱ nu uba̱ta̱ wu usowoto wu upepu reve we ene Da̱wuda mogono a tsu'yan nu uje'en a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu u goro yi o okolo a̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na Akpati a̱ A̱sulazuva'a a̱vu a zuwa yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi, a̱tsuma̱ o oogodo a na Da̱wuda foɓoo niyi. Reve Da̱wuda ca ikucci yu ukula̱tosu na̱ kucci muwwulai a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Mantsa ma na Da̱wuda kotoi ucasu u kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ kucci muwwulai'i, reve u zuwaa ama'a aba'un na ala a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />A̱vu u ne'eshen iɓolo ya ama a Isra'ila na akpatali o opopofu, na apaɗi a nama no ogbodolu a̱ muwun n ina̱bi o u'yewu za va Isra'ila suru ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci. Reve ama suru e bete'we a̱ ka̱mba̱ a 'wa le.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Ana Da̱wuda ka̱mba̱i o u'wa adama u zuwaa u'wa wa̱ yi aba'un, reve Mikal usheli wa Shawulu wu uta̱ u cina yi, reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Cine mogono ma Isra'ila ma cayi aciya̱yi tsugbain ana'an, a na u lyawai aciya̱yi ataɓu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma agbashi e esheli agbashi a̱ yi, cine vu revei za na lambai wono!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Reve Da̱wuda usu Mikal u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma ɗa n je'ein, za na ɗangwa numu zagbain va ama a̱ A̱sulazuva a aza a Isra'ila o una̱ wa dada va̱ wu nu u'wa wa̱ yi suru. N ta yuwan mere a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />N ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ aciya̱va̱ ili i wono i na i la'ai ili i nda, waru n to o'wo ili i pere e ekere a̱ ɗu. Amma adama a ɗa a agbashi e esheli a na vu yuwain adanshi a aci e le, a ta ca mu tsugbain.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Adama o ndolo gba Mikal usheli wa Shawulu u tsura̱ limatan shi hali ukwisa̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Nzuwulai ma̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tyo ya̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1 Alb 17:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 22:7-10">22:7-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Mantsa ma na mogono Dawuda da̱nuyi o ukobu wa̱ yi, reve waru A̱sulazuva a ca yi wivuwun e ekere a n'yuwatan ma̱ yi n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwa̱ na̱ a̱yi suru, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />reve mogono ma damma Natan vumava̱sula̱, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, a̱mu ɗa nda nden o ukobu wa akpata a ɗanga sida, amma Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱ uzuwu o oogodo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Reve Natan usu mogono u damma, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu yuwan ili i na i ri o okolo a̱ wu suru, adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Amma na ayin o ndolo A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Natan u damma, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />&lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu damma aagbashi a̱ va̱ Da̱wuda: &lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, a̱vu ɗa za na aa suwaa mu u'wa u na ma̱a̱ da̱nu shi. <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Koto n da̱nu o u'wa shi diga mantsa ma na mu uta̱yi aza a Isra'ila diga e iɗa ya Masar hali a cina ana'an. Amma n te igaru ba̱ta̱ ba̱ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o oogodo za na wo o'woi uba̱ta̱ wu nden n va̱. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Uba̱ta̱ u na n 'ya̱wa̱i na aza a Isra'ila suru, koto me ece azagbain a Isra'ila, a na n zuwai a na aa guɓa ama a̱ va̱ aza a Isra'ila suru, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai koto i suwaa numu u'wa na akpata a sida shi?&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />&lt;&lt;To gogo, vu damma Da̱wuda aagbashi a̱ va̱, &lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai: N tara wu ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa aguɓa u na vaa guɓusa mgbele, adama mo o'woto wu zagbain va ama a̱ va̱ aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />N da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu uba̱ta̱ u na vu 'ya̱wa̱i biti, waru n kototo ta̱ n'yuwatan ma̱ wu elime a̱ wu suru. N ta ca wu ala a gbain, cine vu revei ala a azagbain suru suru a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Waru n ta ca ama a̱ va̱ aza a Isra'ila uba̱ta̱ a̱vu n shuwa̱ le, tsa̱ra̱ a̱ da̱na̱ nu uba̱ta̱ wa aciyele. Waru a buwa a̱ da̱shi damaton le shi. Waru ama a wuya a̱a̱ da̱shi ɓongi le cine a yuwusain nu ufaru shi, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />diga a mantsa ma na n zuwai a̱za̱ o uge'etosu wa ama a̱ va̱ aza a Isra'ila. N ta ca wu wivuwun e ekere a n'yuwatan ma̱ wu biti. A̱mu A̱sulazuva a ɗa a damma nuwu, a̱mu na aciya̱va̱ a ɗa ma̱a̱ shuwa̱ u'wa wa̱ wu. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Na̱ rana va̱ wu shiwan vu ta̱ kuwa̱ vu cine nkaya ma̱ wu, n ta ya̱sa̱n mawun ma̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na vu matsain, za na oo uta̱ a mpasa ma̱ wu, a̱vu n zuwa tsugono tsa̱ yi tsa̱ shuwa̱.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ica 89:3-4; Ica 132:11; Ajy 2:30.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />A̱yi ɗa waa suwa u'wa adama a Ala a̱ va̱, waru n ta̱ shuwa̱ ootogu o tsugono tsa̱ yi babu okotu. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />N to o'wo dada va̱ yi, a̱yi waru wo o'wo ulobo u va̱. Nu u yuwan unusu, n ta ca yi oforo ununa dada tsu ca mawun ma̱ yi oforo na aasuɗu. Waru ama ɗa oo o'wo asuɗu a̱ va̱.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ica 89:26-27; 2 Kor 6:18; M.Ib 1:5.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Amma icigi i va̱ i na i tsu vadala shi yaa kasa na̱ a̱yi cine n usa niyi uba̱ta̱ wa Shawulu shi, za na n tawai a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />U'wa wa̱ wu na̱ tsugono tsa̱ wu tsu ta lyuwa elime a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱ hali hali. Ootogu o tsugono tsa̱ wu tsu ta̱ shuwa̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ica 89:36-37.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Reve Natan ka̱mbuwa̱ Da̱wuda idanshi yu udammu i na A̱sula̱ a cuɗuwa niyi suru.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Avasa a̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1 Alb 17:16-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Reve Da̱wuda mogono ma̱ 'ya̱wa̱ u uwa o oogodo a na o foɓoyi Akpati a Nzuwulai A̱sulazuva u da̱nu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva reve u yuwan avasa u damma, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa a̱mu n ri A̱sulazuva Zagbain, nye i ɗa waru u'wa u va̱, a na vu rawato numu uba̱ta̱ u nda? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Agba suru na̱ ne ili i ke'en i ɗa e ekere a̱ wu, A̱sulazuva Zagbain. Vu yuwan ta̱ waru adanshi e isa'ani ye elime o u'wa wa aagbashi a̱ wu. Tsundolo tsa ɗa vu tsu yuwusan na̱ vuma, A̱sulazuva Zagbain!<verse eid="2SA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />&lt;&lt;Ili i ne i ɗa waru a̱mu Da̱wuda ma̱a̱ da̱shi damma wu? Adama a na vu reve ta̱ ɗe aagbashi a̱ wu, A̱sulazuva Zagbain. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Adama adanshi a̱ wu ni ili i na okolo a̱ wu a cigai, ɗaɗa vu yuwain ili i gbain i nda suru a̱vu vu lyawa aagbashi a̱ wu e reve le.<verse eid="2SA 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu zagbain ɗa lon, A̱sulazuva Zagbain! Babu lo za tsa̱ wu, waru babu lo A̱sula̱ she a̱vu, cine tsu uwwai na atsuvu a̱ tsu suru. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />To zane ɗa ri lo tsa ama a̱ wu aza a Isra'ila, iɗa i ta̱ i na i ri o uvaɗi za na vu tsupayi o o'wo ama a̱ wu, vu yuwaan ta̱ aciya̱wu ala reve waru vu yuwaan le ili i gbagbain i wovon ya asalama a na vu loyi nɗa na̱ musula̱ n le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma ama a̱ wu, aza a na vu tsupayi diga Masar?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: U.Wl 4:34.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Vu zuwa ta̱ ama a̱ wu aza a Isra'ila a̱ shuwa̱ hali hali. Waru a̱vu A̱sulazuva vo o'wo ta̱ A̱sula̱ e le.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: U.Wl 29:13.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />&lt;&lt;Gogo A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱, shiton nzuwulai n na vu yuwayin aagbashi a̱ wu nu u'wa wa̱ yi hali hali. Vu yuwan cine vu dammai, <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />tsa̱ra̱ ala a̱ wu a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ tsugbain hali hali. Ama'a a ta damma, &lt;A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila a ɗa!&gt; Waru u'wa wa aagbashi a̱ wu Da̱wuda u ta shuwa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu.<verse eid="2SA 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />&lt;&lt;Amma adama a̱ wu A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila, a̱vu ɗa vu rocoi aagbashi a̱ wu, a dansa, &lt;N ta shuwa̱ u'wa wa̱ wu.&gt; A̱yi ɗa i zuwai aagbashi a̱ wu a̱ tsura̱i ugbamu wo okolo a na waa yuwan avasa a nda a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ wu. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />To, A̱sulazuva Zagbain, a̱vu ɗa A̱sula̱! Waru idanshi ya̱ wu amayun a ɗa, waru a̱vu ɗa vu yuwayin aagbashi a̱ wu nzuwulai me ili isa'ani i nda. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Gogo lyawa u lobono wu, vu yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ vu zuwaa u'wa wa aagbashi a̱ wu aba'un, adama u lyuwa elime a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu hali hali. A̱sulazuva Zagbain, vu yuwan ta̱ adanshi, waru na aba'un a̱ wu a ɗa u'wa wa aagbashi a̱ wu wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ na aba'un hali hali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Ulyuwu wa aci wa̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:1-13">1 Alb 18:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi, reve Da̱wuda lyuwa aza a Filistiya nu uvon, a̱vu u ta̱wa̱ nu ukosu u tsugbain tsa̱ le a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a. A̱vu u usa lyuci va Mete Ammah e ekere a aza a Filistiya.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />A̱vu u lyuwa a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa nu uvon. Reve u zuwa le o von e iɗa ugeru ugeru, a̱vu u rito le na amunga o uritosu wu usaa. Uritowu u re suru a̱vu u zuwa o una le, a̱vu a lyawa uritowu wa ta'atsu wuma. A̱vu ama a̱ Mowa o'wo agbashi a̱ Da̱wuda, a̱vu a casu yi utafa u le.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Da̱wuda lyuwa ta̱ ulobo wa Rehob za na a̱ tsu ɗe Hadadeza mogono ma̱ Zoba vi iɗa ya Suriya nu uvon a mantsa ma na u da̱na̱i a mmalu a̱ tyo upasu wu Uɗolu wa̱ Yufiriti, adama u ka̱mbuwisa̱ uba̱ta̱'a̱ za̱la̱ vu ucira va̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />A̱vu Da̱wuda reme akumbi e ido o mogono ma̱ Zoba ukpakukupa nu ukpakucindere (1,700), na̱ a̱soja a na a̱ da̱na̱i a ana ukpakukupa ushin (20,000). Da̱wuda kutsuma̱to ta̱ ido'o suru amma u lyawa ta̱ ido i na yoo ronuso ikeke ukpaku (100).<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Ana a̱soja a Suriya a Dimaska a̱ ta̱wa̱i adama a kamba Hadadeza mogono ma̱ Zoba, a̱vu Da̱wuda una a̱soja ukpakukupa ushin nu ukpakukupa ure (22,000). <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Reve Da̱wuda shuwa̱ va̱la̱ta̱ vo oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a̱tsuma̱ a Dimaska va Suriya. Ɗaɗa aza a Suriya o o'woi agbashi a̱ Da̱wuda reve a casu yi utafa. A̱vu A̱sulazuva a casu ta̱ Da̱wuda ulyuwu wa aci uba̱ta̱ u na u 'ya̱wa̱i biti.<verse eid="2SA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />A̱vu Da̱wuda pura̱ a̱ra̱ga̱ a zinariya ya yali ya̱ a̱soja a Hadadeza a̱vu u ta̱wa̱ ne ele Urishelima. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Waru a̱tsuma̱ a Beta na̱ Berotai e ilyuci ya Hadadeza, Da̱wuda mogono ma̱ pura̱ ta̱ irumushili na̱ a̱bunda̱.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Ana Toyi mogono ma Hamat ma uwwai a na Da̱wuda lyuwa ta̱ a̱soja a Hadadeza nu uvon ma̱ɓula̱, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />reve u lyungu ulobo wa̱ yi Yoram uba̱ta̱ u mogono Da̱wuda u ca̱sa̱ yi reve waru u cuwa yi nu ulyuwu wa aci u na u lyuwai Hadadeza nu uvon za na da̱na̱i o uvon na̱ Toyi. Yoram gba u ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ Da̱wuda ni itana i azurufa na̱ zinariya na̱ rumushili.<verse eid="2SA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Mogono Da̱wuda tawaa ta̱ A̱sulazuva itana i nda suru cine u tawai azurufa na̱ zinariya aza a na wu usai uba̱ta̱ a nɗa n na u lyuwai nu uvon suru, <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />ele ɗa aza a Edom na̱ Mowa na̱ Amon na̱ Filistiya oɓolo na̱ Amaleka. Waru u tawa ta̱ ili i na a pura̱i uba̱ta̱ o uvon e ekere o mogono Hadadeza ma̱ Zoba ulobo wa Rehob.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Da̱wuda gba yuwan ta̱ ala a na u ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ o uvon na wu unai aza a Edom ukpakukupa kupa na̱ ukpakukupa kunla̱ (18,000), o Uka̱ri wa Akpaɗi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ica 60 Aciya adanshi e ishipa.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Reve Da̱wuda shuwisa̱ va̱la̱ta̱ vo oɓolo a̱ a̱soja uba̱ta̱ suru e iɗa ya Edom. Reve ama a Edom o'wo agbashi a̱ yi. A̱sulazuva a ca ta̱ Da̱wuda ulyuwu wa aci uba̱ta̱ u na u 'ya̱wa̱i suru.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Azagbain a̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:14-17">1 Alb 18:14-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Reve Da̱wuda yuwan tsugono a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila ma̱ɓula̱, u yuwusan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege na̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a ama a̱ yi suru. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yowab za na mma va̱ yi ɗa Zeruya, a̱yi ɗa u da̱na̱i yali ya̱ a̱soja. Jehoshafa ulobo wa Ahilu a̱yi ɗa za na tsu ɗanasa ili i na i farai. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Saduku ulobo wa Ahitu na̱ Ahimele ulobo wa Abiyata ele ɗa nan ganu. Seraya a̱yi ɗa za vi iɗana. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya ulobo wa Jehoyida a̱yi ɗa zagbain va aza a Keretiya na̱ aza a Feletiya, a̱soja a na a yuwusan ipiri ya̱ Da̱wuda. Waru olobo a̱ Da̱wuda ele ɗa nan ganu.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda roco ta̱ Mefiboshe isa'ani ya amayun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Uranu u ro reve Da̱wuda yuwan yeci u damma, &lt;&lt;Ko nanza buwa ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa Shawulu za na moo roco isa'ani ya amayun adama a̱ Jonata?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 20:15-17; 2 Sam 21:7.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />A mantsa'a aagbashi o ro a̱ shi ta̱ lo za na aa yuwusan ulinga u tsugbashi o u'wa wa Shawulu za na a̱ tsu ɗe Ziba. Reve e ɗe yi u ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono Da̱wuda, a̱vu mogono me ece yi, &lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗaɗa Ziba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Reve u usu, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima, a̱mu ɗaɗa aagbashi a̱ wu, mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />A̱vu mogono me ece yi, &lt;&lt;Babu za ro na buwai a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa Shawulu za na moo roco isa'ani ya amayun cine A̱sula̱ a tsu yuwan?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Reve Ziba usu mogono, &lt;&lt;Ulobo wa Jonata za na ri a̱kutsuma̱ ana ra ra ra ta̱ lo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 4:4.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Reve mogono me ece yi, &lt;&lt;Te ɗa u ri?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">A̱vu Ziba usu mogono, &lt;&lt;U ta̱ ɗe o u'wa wa Maki ulobo wa Amiyel a̱ lyuci va Lodeba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Ɗaɗa mogono Da̱wuda ma̱ lyunguyi a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi diga Lodeba, diga o u'wa wa Maki ulobo wa Amiyel.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Ana Mefiboshe ulobo wa Jonata, mawun ma tsukaya ma Shawulu ma rawai uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda, reve u kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi e iɗa. Reve Da̱wuda damma, &lt;&lt;Mefiboshe!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Reve Mefiboshe usu yi, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima, apa aagbashi a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Reve Da̱wuda damma yi, &lt;&lt;She vu uwwa wovon wan, adama a na n to roco wu isa'ani ya amayun adama a dada va̱ wu Jonata. Waru n ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ wu iɗa i na suru yo o'woi za va kaka va̱ wu Shawulu ɗa, waru vu ta̱ da̱na̱ a lyuwusa ilyalya oɓolo na̱ a̱mu a apada a̱ va̱ kuci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />A̱vu Mefiboshe kingyowisa̱ nu urewesu wa̱ yi she e iɗa, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Hali nye i ɗa aagbashi a̱ wu, a na vaa tara yi ili i ro? A̱mu aagbashi a̱ wu a ɗa a na a la'ai a̱a̱kwa̱kwa̱ a̱ musa̱n shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Ɗaɗa mogono ma̱ ɗeyi Ziba aagbashi a Shawulu, reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;N ca ta̱ mawun ma tsukaya ma zagbain va̱ wu Shawulu, suru ili i na yo o'woi za va Shawulu nu u'wa wa̱ yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 16:1; 2 Sam 19:24.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Waru a̱vu no olobo a̱ wu na agbashi a̱ wu i ta̱ da̱na̱ a yuwusaan u'wa wa Shawulu cimba, waru i ta̱wa̱a̱ le ni itana yu uɗuma̱ adama a̱ tsura̱ ilyalya. Amma Mefiboshe mawun ma tsukaya ma zagbain va̱ wu ma̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a lyuwusa ilyalya oɓolo na̱ a̱mu a apada a̱ va̱ kuci.&gt;&gt; Ziba gba u ta̱ na̱ olobo gendu na agbashi ushin.<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Reve Ziba usu mogono'o, &lt;&lt;Aagbashi a̱ wu a ta yuwan ili i na suru zagbain va̱ mogono ma damma niyi u yuwan.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Mefiboshe lyuwai elime a lyuwusa ilyalya a apada o mogono Da̱wuda tsa akapi o olobo o mogono.<verse eid="2SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefiboshe gba da̱na̱ ta̱ nu ulobo u ke'en za na a̱ tsu ɗe Mika. Reve vuma suru o u'wa wa Ziba wo o'wo agbashi a Mefiboshe. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />A̱vu Mefiboshe da̱nu Urishelima, adama a na mantsa suru u ta lyuwusa a apada o mogono kuci. A̱yi gba a̱kutsuma̱ a ɗa ana a̱ yi ra ra ra.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda lyuwa ta̱ aza a Amon nu uvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1 Alb 19:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi ɗaɗa Nahash mogono ma aza a Amon ma̱ kuwa̱i, reve Hanun ulobo wa̱ yi mo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Reve Da̱wuda damma, &lt;&lt;N to roco Hanun ulobo wa Nahash isa'ani ya amayun, cine dada va̱ yi roco numu isa'ani ya amayun.&gt;&gt; Reve Da̱wuda lyungu nlingata a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ ca̱sa̱ yi na̱ wirota̱ adama o ukwa̱ wa dada va̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Ana nlingata'a n rawai a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Amon, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />a̱vu azagbain a Amon a damma Hanun mogono me le, &lt;&lt;Vu ta majiyan Da̱wuda ta casu dada va̱ wu tsugbain a na u lyunguwa̱ nuwu aza a na a̱ ca̱sa̱ wu na̱ wirota̱? Ashe ugbozu u ɗa u yuwain nda'a tsura̱ e idana lyuci tsu, waru a tawa yi utyo, na we e reve ucira u tsu adama a lyuwa tsu nu uvon shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Ɗaɗa Hanun remei nlingata ma̱ Da̱wuda'a a̱vu u puna le ntsuka̱ upasu u ta̱ a̱vu wu paɗa le a̱tugu o ugundo. Reve u lyawa le a̱ ka̱ra̱.<verse eid="2SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Ana a dammai Da̱wuda mogono aɗa a nda, reve u lyungu nlingata a cina ama'a, adama a na a zuwa le ta̱ a uwwa wono lon. Mogono ma damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Yi isawan Jeriko hali ntsuka̱ n ɗu n kungwa, reve i ka̱mba̱ a̱ wa̱ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Ana aza a Amon e revei o'wo ta̱ ili yu upan e ekere a̱ Da̱wuda adama e ili i na a yuwain, reve a tara okopu a̱ a̱soja a Suriya ukpakukupa ushin (20,000), diga Bet Reho na̱ Zoba, oɓolo na̱ mogono ma Ma'aka na̱ a̱soja ukpakukupa (1,000) na ama ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa ure (12,000) diga Tob.<verse eid="2SA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Ana Da̱wuda uwwai ne a̱vu u lyungu Yowab na̱ a̱soja a na a gurai uvon suru adama a yuwan uvon ne ele. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Reve aza a Amon o uta̱ a dara adama o uvon o una̱ntsu u lyuci gbain le, a̱vu fo aza a Suriya diga Zoba na̱ Reho na̱ a̱soja a Tob na̱ Ma'aka a dara a agalaci ko'o.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Ana Yowab enei u ta yuwan uvon elime na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱, reve u ɗangula a̱soja o ro aza a na a la'a gurai uvon diga a̱tsuma̱ a ali a Isra'ila adama a yuwan uvon na aza a Suriya. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />A̱vu u zuwa akapi a̱ a̱soja za̱la̱ tsugbain tsa Abishai zawa'a va̱ yi adama u rono le aaɗanga, avu Abishai dara le adama a yuwan uvon na aza a Amon. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />A̱vu Yowab damma Abishai, &lt;&lt;Na aza a Suriya a la'a ucira u va̱ vu ta̱wa̱ vu kamba mu, amma n na ama a Amon a la'a ta̱ ucira wa̱ wu, n ta̱ ta̱wa̱ n kamba wu. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Tsu kaɓa asuvu, tsu yuwan nla̱ngi nu ucira adama a ama a̱ tsu, na̱ lyuci va̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu. Lyawa A̱sulazuva a yuwan ili i na i lobono niyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Ana Yowab na̱ a̱soja a̱ yi a̱ zura̱i zuzu adama e teme uvon, reve gba a̱soja a Suriya a suma. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Ana aza a Amon enei aza a Suriya e ilaɗi, reve ele fo a suma a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Abishai reve a uwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci. Ɗaɗa Yowab ka̱mba̱i Urishelima diga uba̱ta̱ o uvon na aza a Amon.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Ana a̱soja a Suriya enei a̱soja a Isra'ila a lyuwa le ta̱ nu uvon, reve o ɓoloto aciyele. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Hadadeza mogono lyungu ta̱ a̱soja a̱ ta̱wa̱ na aza a Suriya a na a̱ ri mavada mo Uɗolu wa̱ Yufireti. Reve a rawa a̱ lyuci va Helam na̱ Shoba yali ya̱ a̱soja a Hadadeza elime e le.<verse eid="2SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Ana a dammai Da̱wuda aɗa a nda, reve u ɓoloto a̱soja a Isra'ila suru uba̱ta̱ u ta̱, reve a pasalai Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu a̱ tyo Helam. Reve a̱soja a Suriya a dara aciyele, a̱vu e reme uvon na̱ Da̱wuda. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Amma a̱soja a Suriya a sumaa ta̱ a̱soja a Isra'ila. A̱vu Da̱wuda una a̱soja a Suriya akumbi e ikeke yi ido ukpakucindere (700) na̱ a̱soja akumbi e ido ukpakukupa amunga (40,000). Reve a amaton Shoba yali ya̱ a̱soja a Suriya, hali u kuwa̱ lo.<verse eid="2SA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Ana ngono n na n ri za̱la̱ tsugono tsa Hadadeza suru enei aza a Isra'ila a lyuwa ta̱ aci e le nu uvon, reve a zami nden ma alafiya na aza a Isra'ila, a̱vu o'wo agbashi e le. Ɗaɗa aza a Suriya a uwwai wovon u na a̱a̱ da̱shi kamba aza a Amon.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda na̱ Bashaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Mantsa ma na lyushi rawai, a na ngono n tsu ꞌya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ o uvon, a̱vu Da̱wuda lyungu Yowab oɓolo na̱ azagbain a̱ yi na̱ a̱soja a Isra'ila suru a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱ uvon. O kototo ta̱ aza a Amon, a̱vu a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ lyuci va Raba nu uvon. Amma Da̱wuda gba da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 20:1">1 Alb 20:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Urana u ro nu ulivu, Da̱wuda 'yon ta̱ a̱ a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ yi, a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ a mmalu zuva vu ukwa̱'a̱ wu ukobu u tsugono, a̱yi ɗe zuva, a̱vu we ene ka ro o usumbu. Waru ka'a u tu ulobonu wa'ashi. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />A̱vu u lyungu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ e revee yi ko ka ne ɗa. Reve vuma'a u damma, &lt;&lt;Ashe a̱yi nda Bashaba ɗa shi, usheli wa Eliyam ka va Uriya vuma va Hitiya shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />A̱vu Da̱wuda lyungu nlingata a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ yi na̱ kaꞌa. Cina gba u koto usumbu wa̱ a̱shinda̱ wa̱ yi adama wo o'wo cece, a na u ta̱wa̱i ya̱'a̱ yi reve u von na̱ a̱yi. A̱vu ka'a u ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ o uꞌwa. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Reve ka'a u tara a̱a̱tsuma̱ reve u lyunguwa̱a̱ Da̱wuda na adanshi a na, &lt;&lt;N ta̱ na̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Reve Da̱wuda lyunguwa̱a̱ Yowab nu udammu u damma, &lt;&lt;Lyunguwa̱a̱ mu Uriya vuma va Hitiya.&gt;&gt; Reve Yowab lyunguwa̱a̱ yi na̱ Uriya. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Ana u rawai, reve we ece yi ko Yowab na̱ a̱soja a̱ ta̱ ɗe gbaga, na̱ cine uvoꞌon u ri ɗe a mmalu. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Reve Da̱wuda damma yi, &lt;&lt;Wala a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ wu vu sa'a ana a̱ wu reve vi ivuwan.&gt;&gt; Ana Uriya lyawai ukobu u mogono, ɗaɗa mogono ma̱ lyunguwa̱a̱ niyi nu une'e. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Uriya gba u tyo o u'wa shi. O una̱ntsu wu ukobu u mogono u ɗa wa asai oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri i mogono.<verse eid="2SA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Ana Da̱wuda uwwai a na Uriya tyo o u'wa wa̱ yi shi, ɗaɗa we ece niyi, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu ꞌya̱wa̱i o uꞌwa yon shi, a̱vu ɗa nda vu shi pa shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Reve Uriya usu yi, &lt;&lt;Akpati a Nzuwulai na̱ a̱soja a Isra'ila na aza a Yahuda a̱ ta̱ ɗe nden o ogodo. Waru Yowab yali ya̱ a̱soja na̱ azagbain a̱ ta̱ ɗe uva̱lu uba̱ta̱ o uvon a agalaci. Cine tsa ɗa ma̱a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱ o uꞌwa, n lyuwa n sowo, a̱vu n von na̱ ka va̱? N kucina ta̱ na̱ a̱vu, maa yuwan cuꞌun vi ili i ndolo shi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma Uriya, &lt;&lt;Na̱ ne ɗa, she va asisa pa hali nfaꞌan. Reve vu ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Uriya isawain a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima hali usana u ro u tawa. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Ana usana u tawai a̱vu Da̱wuda banu yi alya waru u sowo oɓolo na̱ a̱yi hali wo o'woto yi usowu. Suru na̱ ne na ayin o ndolo Uriya ꞌya̱wa̱ o uꞌwa wa̱ yi shi. Reve wa asisa a aavalu a̱ yi o ukobu u mogono oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri i mogono.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Ana usana u tawai, reve Da̱wuda ɗanaa Yowab mepepelime, a̱vu u ca Uriya ꞌya̱wa̱a̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />E mepepelimeꞌe, u ɗana ta̱ pe, &lt;&lt;Vu zuwa Uriya elime o uvon, uba̱ta̱ u na u la'ai usuɗuwu, reve i rono na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱, i lyawa yi tsa̱ra̱ a̱ ga̱la̱ yi o una yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Reve a mantsa ma na Yowab ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i lyuci'i nu uvon, reve u ca̱co Uriya uba̱ta̱ u na u revei aza a na a gurai uvon a̱ ri. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Ana a̱soja a̱ lyuci'i o uta̱i a yuwain uvon na̱ Yowab, o una ta̱ azagbain a̱ Da̱wuda o ro. Waru Uriya vuma va Hitiya da̱na̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na o unai.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Ɗaɗa Yowab lyunguwa̱yi Da̱wuda na alabari o uvo'on suru. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />A̱vu Yowab damma malingata'a: &lt;&lt;Na̱ vu koto a dansaa mogono alabari o uvo'on suru, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />n na̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ la̱nga̱ mogono'o, reve we ece wu, &lt;Nye i zuwai i 'ya̱wa̱i uvon zuzu na̱ lyuci'i? A̱ɗu i reve a na ee tewin iliya diga o ukari u na u ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i lyuci'i shi? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Agba i gura cuwan ni ili i na i cinai Abimele ulobo wa Yerubeshe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yerubeshe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aala o ro a Gidiyon a ɗa.</char></note> shi? A̱tsuma̱ a Tebe ka ɗa variyi aakiri a yira diga o ukari u lyuci'i, reve gba aakiri'i a̱ riya̱a̱ yi a aaci, a̱vu wu una yi shi? Nye i zuwai i rawai zuzu nu ukari'i?&gt; Na̱ we ece ne, reve vu damma yi, &lt;Uriya aagbashi a̱ wu vuma va Hitiya fo u kuwa̱ ta̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:53">A̱.Ug 9:53</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Reve malingata'a u ka̱ra̱. Ana u rawai reve u damma mogono Da̱wuda ili i na suru Yowab damma niyi u damma. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />A̱vu malingata'a u damma mogono, &lt;&lt;Nu ufaru n'yuwatan n tsu n shi ta̱ n la'a ucira u tsu, o uta̱ ta̱ a agalaci tsa̱ra̱ a yuwan uvon na̱ a̱tsu, amma tsu gba̱ra̱ le ta̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'uwata wu una̱ntsu u lyuci'i. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Reve ali o uvon a na a̱ da̱na̱i na̱ tan na aya e tewin iliya diga o ukari u lyuci'i, reve o una akapi a azagbain o mogono. Waru aagbashi a̱ wu Uriya vuma va Hitiya fo u kuwa̱ ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Reve Da̱wuda damma malingata'a, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mba̱ vu damma Yowab, &lt;She a̱yi ndolo ɓa̱li wu wan. Matsun me pe'eni ma tsu ɗangula za na woo una shi. Da̱shi dakanuyi o uvon na̱ lyuci'i, hali she ni i lyuwa yi nu uvon.&gt; Vu damma ne Yowab tsa̱ra̱ u da̱shi tsura̱ ucira.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Ana Bashaba ka va Uriya uwwai vali va̱ yi kuwa̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ o uvon, u yuwan ta̱ nden n wirota̱ adama a̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Ana mantsa ma̱ nden n wirota̱ mo kotoi, a̱vu Da̱wuda zuwa a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ ka'a o u'wa wa̱ yi, reve wo oꞌwo ka va̱ yi. A̱vu u matsaan yi mawun mo ulobo, agba A̱sulazuva a uwwa uyoꞌo wi iwuya i na Da̱wuda yuwain shi.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Natan ɓara ta̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />A̱sulazuva a̱ lyungu ta̱ Natan vumava̱sula̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda u damma yi alabari a nda. Ana u rawai uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;A yuwan ta̱ ama e re a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci ro. Za ta̱ za vu utsuru za ta̱ waru za vu ulambu. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Za vu utsuru'u u ta̱ na̱ mgbele ni inan ya̱ a̱bunda̱ lon. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Amma za vu ulambuꞌu gba u ri ni ili shi, she a̱na̱wun o mokyokyon ma̱ ta̱ ma na u tsulai. U ca yi ta̱ ilyalya ulobonu hali u kungwa oɓolo na̱ a̱yi na̱ muwun ma̱ yi. U tsu ca yi ta̱ ilyalya i na a̱yi a aciya̱yi u tsu lyuwa, waru u tsu sowo ta̱ mini a yanda yo oso a̱ mini ma̱ yi, waru u tsu von ta̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi. Wo oꞌwo ta̱ tsu usheli wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />&lt;&lt;Urana u ro, reve za vu utsuru'u u yuwan mocin o u'wa wa̱ yi. Agba u ciga u tara megbele ma̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ mgbele ko inan ya̱ yi u paɗaa mocin va̱ yi shi. Ɗaɗa u remei a̱na̱wun o mokyokyon ma̱ za vu ulambuꞌu, reve u paɗaa mocin va̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Da̱wuda uwwa ta̱ upan wu za vu utsuru'u lon, a̱vu u damma Natan, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ wuma, vuma na yuwain ili i nda u rawa ta̱ o una yi! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Reve waru a na we enei iliyali yi za vu ulambu u ndolo shi, u tsupa ikebe ya̱ a̱na̱wun o mokyokyon mo ndolo toto una̱shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Reve Natan damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗa vuma'a! Waru nda ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila a dammai: &lt;N tsuwa̱n wu ta̱ mani'in vo oꞌwo mogono ma aza a Israꞌila, waru n wawa wu ta̱ e ekere a Shawulu. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />N ca wu ta̱ u'wa wu zagbain va̱ wu, hali na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ yi. Reve waru n ca wu u'wa wa aza a Isra'ila na̱ Yahuda. Waru ne ele ndolo a̱ shi a rawa wu shi, n shi ta̱ a̱ da̱shi wu ili i na i la'ai ndolo. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Nye i zuwai vu goroi adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva, reve vu yuwan ili i wuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi? Vu zuwa ta̱ o una Uriya vuma va Hitiya a̱tsuma̱ o uvon a na vu zuwai aza a Amon o una niyi na̱ matsun me pe'eni, a̱vu vu tara ka va̱ yi wo o'wo ka va̱ wu. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />To, gogo adama o ndolo matsun me pe'eni maa kasa nu u'wa wa̱ wu shi hali hali. Adama a na vu goro numu, reve vu tara ka va Uriya vuma va Hitiya wo o'wo ka va̱ wu.&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />&lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;Adama e ili i na vu yuwain, n ta zuwa za ro diga o u'wa wa̱ wu u 'ya̱sa̱a̱n wu aci. Waru e esu a̱ wu a ɗa maa usa a̱ma̱ci a̱ wu reve n ca moron ma̱ nden ma̱ wu, waru vuma'a u to von na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ wu nu urana kpasa kpasa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11-12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 16:22.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Vu yuwan ta̱ ili i nda usokowu, amma a̱mu n ta yuwaan wu ili i nda nu urana kpasa kpasa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma aza a Isra'ila suru.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma Natan, &lt;&lt;N yuwaan ta̱ A̱sulazuva unusu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Reve Natan usu yi u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a tawa ta̱ unusu wa̱ wu. Va̱a̱ kuwa̱ shi. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Amma adama a adanshi a vama a na vu yuwain, vu zuwa ta̱ nꞌyuwatan ma̱ A̱sulazuva n rono yi e iɗa. Adama o ndolo ulobo u na a matsaan nuwu u ta̱ kuwa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />A̱vu Natan ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo o u'wa. Reve A̱sulazuva a faba ulobo u na ka va Uriya matsayin Da̱wuda'a na̱ mɓa̱la̱. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Da̱wuda pati ta̱ A̱sula̱ o una̱ u mawu'un. Reve u yuwan akuli u uwa a aasula a̱ yi, a̱vu u shon adama a̱ yi reve u von e iɗa ayin ma̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />A̱vu mbara mu u'wa wa̱ yi n ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi adama e le'eshe yi u yon pe e iɗa'a, agba u 'yuwan ta̱, reve fo u 'yuwan a lyuwa ilyalya oɓolo ne ele.<verse eid="2SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Ele lo o urana we cindere, a̱vu mawu'un ma̱ kuwa̱. A̱vu mbara'a a uwwa wovon u na aa damma yi a na mawu'un ma̱ kuwa̱i. A̱vu agagulai va̱ni le, &lt;&lt;Mantsa ma na mawu'un ma̱ da̱na̱i wuma tsu ca yi ta̱ adanshi agba wu uwwa tsu shi. Cine tsa ɗa tsaa damma yi mawu'un ma̱ kuwa̱ ta̱? Na amayun u ta gura amaton aciya̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Ana Da̱wuda enei mbara'a e yemenu va̱ ni le, a̱vu u reve a na mawu'un ma̱ kuwa̱ ta̱, ɗaɗa we ece nle, &lt;&lt;Mawu'un ma̱ kuwa̱ ta̱?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">A̱vu a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Ee u kuwa̱ ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Reve Da̱wuda 'yon e iɗa'a. Ana u sumba̱i, reve u sukuma mani'in, a̱vu wo oto itana i ro, a̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱ o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva u yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱. Ɗaɗa u ka̱mba̱i o u'wa wa̱ yi reve u damma agbashi a̱ yi a ca yi ilyalya, ɗaɗa u lyuwai.<verse eid="2SA 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />A̱vu mbara ma̱ yi me ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu yuwain ne? Mantsa ma na mawu'un ma̱ da̱na̱i wuma, vu yuwan ta̱ akuli na̱ mesun, agba a̱yi ɗa nda ana u kuwa̱i vu 'yon ta̱ vu lyuwa ilyalya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Reve u usu le, &lt;&lt;Mantsa ma na ulobo'o u da̱na̱i wuma, n yuwan ta̱ akuli na̱ mesun, adama a na n yuwan ta̱ majiyan n damma, &lt;Zane revei ko A̱sulazuva o to roco mu isa'ani u lyawa mawu'un wuma?&gt; <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Amma a na wo o'woi gogo nda u kuwa̱i, nye yaa zuwa mu n yuwan akuli? Waru n ta gura ka̱mba̱to yi? Uranu u ro n ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi, amma a̱yi u ri n yuwan u ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Limatan va Sulemanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />A̱vu Da̱wuda le'eshe Bashaba ka va̱ yi, a̱vu u von na̱ a̱yi. Reve u yuwan a̱tsuma̱ a̱vu u matsaan yi ulobo, reve a ca yi aala Sulemanu. A̱sulazuva a ciga ta̱ mawu'un, <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />reve A̱sulazuva a̱ lyungu Natan vumava̱sula̱ u ca mawu'un aala Yedidaya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="ft">A̱yi aala &lt;&lt;Yedidaya&gt;&gt; urevu wa̱ yi u ɗa &lt;&lt;Macigata ma̱ A̱sulazuva&gt;&gt; na̱ Tsuyahuda.</char></note> adama a na A̱sulazuva a ciga yi ta̱.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda lyuwa ta̱ aza a Raba nu uvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1 Alb 20:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Ana a tarai mantsa Yowab 'ya̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ lyuci gbain va Raba vi iɗa ya Amon nu uvon, a̱yi a zama u usa lyuci'i, <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />reve u lyungu nlingata uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda a damma yi, &lt;&lt;N yuwan ta̱ uvon na̱ Raba waru n reme ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u na lyuci'i va̱a̱ tsura̱sa̱ mini. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Gogo vu ɓoloto akapi a̱ a̱soja reve vu ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ yi nu uvon vu reme lyuci'i. N na̱ ne ɗa shi, n ta̱ gba a usa lyuci'i na aciya ya̱ va̱, reve waru e ɗe yi na ala a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda ɓolotoi a̱soja a̱ yi suru, reve a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Raba. A̱vu u yuwan uvon na̱ lyuci'i hali u usa yi. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />A̱vu u foɗo okokolo o tsugono a aaci o mogono me le. Waru ume wa̱ yi u rawa ta̱ ume u kilo u zinariya mata'atsu na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi, waru u ta̱ pe na atali e ikebe ya̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi. Reve Da̱wuda oto okokolo'o a aaci a̱ yi. A̱vu u pura̱ itana ya̱ a̱bunda̱ i lyuci'i. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />A̱vu Da̱wuda uta̱a̱ ama a̱ lyuci'i, reve u zuwa le a yuwan ulinga na̱ n'inutsu nu ucira, na̱ nshe'en m ma̱ka̱pa̱ na aɓau. Avu waru u zuwa le a yuwan iponu i ci'in. Ne ɗa Da̱wuda yuwain ni ilyuci ya aza a Amon suru. Reve Da̱wuda na̱ a̱soja a̱ yi suru a̱ ka̱mba̱ Urishelima.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Amnon von ta̱ na̱ Tamar nu ucira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi, reve Amnon ulobo u ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o olobo a̱ Da̱wuda uwa icigi ya Tamar usheli wu ulobonu zawa'a va Absalom ulobo wa̱ Da̱wuda.<verse eid="2SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Reve Amnon damaton aciya̱yi hali u banakan adama a Tamar zawa'a va̱ yi vu usheli a na koto u revei vali shi, waru we ene ta̱ waa gura yuwan ili i ro na̱ a̱yi shi.<verse eid="2SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Amma Amnon da̱na̱ ta̱ ni i'utsa̱ za na a̱ tsu ɗe Yonadab ulobo wa Shimeya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shimeya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aala a̱ ta̱ a ɗa na̱ Shama. Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 16:9.</char></note> mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ Da̱wuda. Waru Yonadab ta̱ nu ugbozu lon. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Reve we ece Amnon, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai a̱vu ulobo u mogono vu tsu da̱na̱ urewesu wa̱ wu ulukutu usana suru, agba vu damma mu ili shi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Ɗaɗa Amnon damma niyi, &lt;&lt;N te icigi ya Tamar zawa'a va Absalom mawun ma̱ a̱sha̱wu ma̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Reve Yonadab damma yi, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu von a̱ a̱a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ wu, vu yuwan she damma vu tu ubanakun. Na̱ dada va̱ wu ta̱wa̱ u ka̱lyuwa̱ wu a̱vu vu damma yi, &lt;N te ipati ya̱ wu vu lyawa zawa'a va̱ Tamar ta̱wa̱ u yuwaan mu ilyalya adama n lyuwa, u foɓoo mu ilyalya'a a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱, adama me ene cine waa yuwan a̱vu u towu mu ne ekere a̱ yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Ɗaɗa Amnon voyin she damma u tu ubanakun. Ana mogono ma ta̱wa̱i ma̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ yi, reve Amnon damma yi, &lt;&lt;N te ipati ya̱ wu vu lyawa zawa'a va̱ Tamar ta̱wa̱ u yuwaan mu emeshen a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱, adama u towu mu ne ekere a̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Reve Da̱wuda lyunguwa̱a̱ Tamar diga o ukobu u tsugono u damma, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri vu 'ya̱wa̱ o u'wa wu zakpara va̱ wu Amnon vu yuwaan yi ilyalya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Reve Tamar 'ya̱wa̱ o u'wa wu zakpara va̱ yi, uba̱ta̱ u na u ri nven. A̱vu u tara yira u lapa, reve u yuwaan yi emeshen a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />A̱vu u tara aakwanu reve u tsuwa̱n yi pe u delyo yi, amma a̱vu u 'yuwan a tama. A̱vu Amnon gba̱ra̱ aza a na a yuwusaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱ suru o uta̱, a̱vu suru nle o uta̱ a lyawa yi. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Ɗaɗa Amnon dammai Tamar, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱a̱ mu ne emeshe'en a aasula e nven n va̱ adama vu towu mu ne ekere a̱ wu n tama.&gt;&gt; Reve Tamar tara emeshen a na u kangalai'i a̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱a̱ a aasula e nven ma Amnon zakpara va̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Ana u rawai ne ele zuzu adama u tama, reve u moɗo yi a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Zawa'a va̱ ta̱wa̱ von na̱ a̱mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Reve u usu yi, &lt;&lt;O'o, zakpara va̱, she vu von na̱ a̱mu babu ucigu wan. She cu'un vi ili i nda i fara a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila wan! She vu yuwan ili i wono i nda wan. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />A̱mu gba a̱ te ɗa maa uwa ni ili i wono i va̱ i nda? A̱vu gba waru? Vu to o'wo she damma vuma vama va amayun a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila. Adama o ndolo n ta patishi wu vu yuwan adanshi na̱ mogono, waa putsa wu vu zuwa mu shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Amma Amnon 'yuwan ta̱ a zuwaa yi atsuvu, reve u tsugba yi u von na̱ a̱yi babu ucigu wa̱ yi, adama a na u la'a niyi ucira.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Reve Amnon ima̱ yi lon, hali u la'a cine u shi u ciga niyi. A̱vu Amnon damma yi, &lt;&lt;'Yon vu ka̱ra̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />A̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;O'o, ma̱gba̱ra̱ ma̱ va̱ u to o'wo ili yu uwuyanu i na i la'ai ili i na vu yuwaan numu ɗe.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Amma Amnon 'yuwan ta̱ a uwwa ili i na u damma niyi. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Reve u ɗe ulobo u na waa yuwusaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Uta̱a̱ ka nda a alanga a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱, reve vu katsu una̱ntsu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Reve za na aa yuwusaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱'a̱ uta̱a̱ yi a alanga reve u katsu una̱ntsu'u.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:18">Tamar da̱na̱ ta̱ nu utugu wu ugaɗi wotowu adama a na ne ɗa esheli o mogono a na o koto e revei vali shi a̱ tsu da̱na̱. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Reve Tamar tsun okomo a aaci a̱ yi adama a̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, reve fo wu kara utugu wu ugaɗi u na u da̱na̱i wotowu na̱ a̱yi. A̱vu u koro aaci u reme mmalu, e mesun na̱ wu uta̱yi uɗyo.<verse eid="2SA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Ana Absalom zakpara va̱ yi ece niyi, &lt;&lt;Zakpara va̱ wu Amnon ɗa voyin na̱ a̱vu? Gogo she vu rungwa̱ vawun va̱, a̱yi zakpara va̱ wu ɗa. Waru she vu zuwa ili i nda o okolo a̱ wu wan.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Tamar yuwain nden ma̱ nde'en ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu o u'wa wu zakpara va̱ yi Absalom.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Ana Da̱wuda mogono ma uwai ili i nda suru, a̱vu u yuwan upan lon. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Agba Absalom damma Amnon ko adanshi shi, ko isa'ani ko iwuya shi. U ima̱yi ta̱ Amnon adama a na u von ta̱ na̱ Tamar babu ucigu nu ucira mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun mo usheli ma̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Absalom una ta̱ Amnon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Ana a yuwain a'wan e re reve Absalom zuwa a puna ikyon ya̱ yi aza a na a̱ ri Ba'al Hazo na ri zuzu na̱ lyuci va Ifiramu, reve Absalom banu muwun mo olobo m mogono suru adama a̱ a̱buki alya no oso. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />A̱vu Absalom 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono, reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima! A̱yi ɗa nda a̱za̱ e ipuna yi ikyon a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ mu ta̱ ulinga. Ko u ta̱ yo'ono mogono na azagbain a̱ wu a̱ ta̱wa̱ oɓolo na aagbashi a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Reve mogono ma̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;O'o ulobo u va̱, tsa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ suru shi adama a na tsu to o'wo wu itana lon.&gt;&gt; Reve Absalom damaton yi, agba Da̱wuda 'yuwan ta̱. Amma u zuwaa yi ta̱ aba'un.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Reve Absalom damma, &lt;&lt;Na̱ va̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ shi, vu yuwan ankuri vu zuwa zawa'a va̱ Amnon ta̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">A̱vu mogono me ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai wa̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Amma Absalom lyuwa ta̱ elime nu udamatosun wa̱ yi hali u usu na Amnon na akapi a̱ muwun mo olobo m mogono'o a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Reve Absalom damma agbashi a na a yuwusaan niyi a̱ga̱nda̱, &lt;&lt;I ka̱lyuwusa̱! Mantsa ma na Amnon uwwai uyo'o u masayan ma̱ ina̱bi, waru na̱ n damma ɗu, &lt;Ga̱la̱i Amnon,&gt; reve yu una yi. Yu uwwa wovon wan, a̱mu ɗa n zuwa nɗu. Yi isawan nu ucira nu ukadu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />A̱vu agbashi a na a yuwusaan Absalom a̱ga̱nda̱'a̱ a yuwan na̱ Amnon cine Absalom damma nle. A̱vu akapi o olobo o mogono a̱ 'yon ni ilaɗi a kumba nloli mi ido i le a suma.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i o ure a̱ ka̱mba̱, reve udammu u ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Absalom una ta̱ olobo o mogono'o suru babu za na buwai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />A̱vu mogono ma̱ 'yon wu kara a̱tugu a̱ yi, reve u von e iɗa. A̱vu azagbain a̱ yi fo suru aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i lo mishin a kara a̱tugu e le.<verse eid="2SA 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Amma Yonadab ulobo wa Shimeya mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ Da̱wuda ma damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima zagbain va̱! She vu tara o una ta̱ olobo a̱ wu suru wan, Amnon ɗa goon o unai. Adama a na Absalom foɓo ta̱ ne diga urana u na Amnon voyin na̱ vawun ma̱ yi Tamar nu ucira babu ucigu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Gogo zagbain va̱ mogono she vu dama adama o udammu wu ukwa̱ wa̱ olobo o mogono suru wan, Amnon ɗa goon kuwa̱i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Absalom gba suma ta̱.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">A̱vu soja na aa yuwusan ipiri a mantsa'a u ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱vu we ene ama a̱bunda̱ a̱ca̱pusa̱ diga o upasu u masasan diga o ure u lyuci wa Horonayim.<verse eid="2SA 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />A̱vu Yonadab damma Da̱wuda mogono, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, olobo o mogono a ɗa nda a̱ ta̱wa̱i, cine aagbashi a̱ wu a dammai. Ne ɗa gba u shiwain.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />A̱yi o mokotoo ma adanshi, a̱vu olobo o mogono a uwa, reve o ɓosho na̱ mesun. A̱vu fo mogono na azagbain a̱ yi o ɓosho fo na̱ mesun babu uyo'o. <verse eid="2SA 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Absalom suma ta̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u mogono Talmai ulobo wa Amihu vu upasu wa Geshu. Amma Da̱wuda mogono ma tara ta̱ mantsa a yuwusan nden n wirota̱ adama o ulobo wa̱ yi Amnon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 3:3.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Ana Absalom sumai a̱ tyo Geshu u da̱nu ta̱ ɗe hali a'wan a ta'atsu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />A̱vu okolo o mogono Da̱wuda a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Absalom, adama a na u sowo ta̱ mini mo uta̱nu a na wo o'woi Amnon kuwa̱ ta̱ ɗe.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Absalom ka̱mba̱ ta̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Ele lo reve Yowab za na mma va̱ yi ɗa Zeruya gura reve a na okolo o mogono a̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Absalom. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Ɗaɗa Yowab lyunguyi nanza a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci va̱ Tekowa a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ yi na̱ ka na ri nu ugbozu. Ana u rawai a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Yuwan she damma vu ta̱ a yuwusan nden n wiruta̱ a̱vu vo oto itana i wiruta̱. She vu sukuma aciya̱wu mani'in wan, a̱vu vu yuwan she damma vu yuwan ta̱ rana a̱bunda̱ a yuwusan nden n wiruta̱ adama a za ro na kuwa̱i. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Reve vu 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono vu damma yi adanshi a nda.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Yowab damma yi ili i na waa damma.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Ana ka va̱ Tekowa'a u rawai uba̱ta̱ u mogono a̱vu u kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi e tyo e iɗa, reve u damma, &lt;&lt;O'o mogono, wawa mu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Reve mogono me ece yi, &lt;&lt;Ili i ne i ɗa ya̱a̱ ɓa̱la̱ wu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Reve u usu yi, &lt;&lt;Amayun a̱mu ma̱runa̱ ma ɗa, vali va̱ kuwa̱ ta̱ ɗe. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />A̱mu aagbashi a̱ wu n ta̱ no olobo e re. A yuwan ta̱ nla̱ngi va̱ni le a aatsusa. Waru babu vuma na aa kakasa le. A̱vu za ta̱ ga̱la̱ za ta̱ hali wu una yi. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Gogo tsunda umatsun suru u ta̱ nla̱ngi na aagbashi a̱ wu, a̱vu a damma, &lt;Ta̱wa̱yi na̱ za na unai mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi, tsa̱ra̱ tsu una yi o una̱ u wuma u mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi ma na wu unai, ko na̱ shi tsu ta̱ o una za na aa lyuwa agadu ɗaɗa.&gt; N na a yuwan ne maa buwa ni ili i ro shi, waru aala a vali va̱ na̱ limatan va̱ yi a̱ ta̱ puwa̱n diga o urewesu wu uvaɗi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />A̱vu mogono ma damma ka'a, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ wu, n ta damma ili i na aa yuwan adama a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Amma ka'a u damma ta̱ mogono, &lt;&lt;Zagbain va̱ mogono, lyawa unusu u da̱na̱ a aci a̱ va̱ nu u'wa wa dada va̱. Amma lyawa mogono no ootogu o tsugono tso o'wo babu unusu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />A̱vu mogono ma damma yi, &lt;&lt;Na̱ za ro damma wu ili i ro, vu ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi uba̱ta̱ u va̱, wa̱a̱ da̱shi damaton wu waru shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />A̱vu ka'a u da̱shi dammisa yi, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima! N ta patishi wu vu cuwan na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu. She vu lyawa za na oo tonishi u tsupa mpasa mu ulobo u va̱ u da̱shi ta̱wa̱a̱ nu ukototosu wan, adama she ulobo u va̱ u na u buwai lo wuma u kuwa̱ wan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Reve mogono Da̱wuda damma, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, ko a̱nji a̱ ta̱ o ulobo wa̱ wu a̱a̱ riya̱ e iɗa shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />A̱vu ka'a u dammisa, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri lyawa aagbashi a̱ wu a̱a̱ da̱shi yuwisan adanshi a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wu zagbain va̱ mogono.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">A̱vu mogono ma̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;Damma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Reve ka'a u damma, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu yuwayin ama a̱ A̱sula̱ ili i ro cine a yuwaan numu? Adama o uge'etosu wa̱ wu, ashe vu ge'eto aciya̱wu shi? Ana vu 'yuwain a̱ ka̱mba̱to ulobo wa̱ wu u na a̱ gba̱ra̱i. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Tsu ciga tsu 'yuwan tsu kuwa̱i, tsa̱ mini ma na mo ocoi e iɗa, waru babu cine a gura purisa̱ yi. Amma A̱sula̱ a tsu tara wuma tsundolo shi, amma u tsu zami ta̱ ure u na wa̱a̱ ka̱mba̱to aza a na a̱ gba̱ra̱i uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Gogo n ta̱wa̱ ta̱ n damma ili i nda uba̱ta̱ wu zagbain va̱ mogono adama a na ama a zuwa mu ta̱ mu uwwa wovon. Ɗaɗa aagbashi a̱ wu a yuwain majiyan a̱vu u damma, &lt;N ta n yuwan adanshi na̱ mogono, u ta gura wo o'wo u ta̱ usu mu u yuwan ili i na m patiyi. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />U ta gura wo o'wo mogono ma̱ ta̱ usu u wawa aagbashi a̱ yi e ekere a vuma na cigai wu una mu oɓolo nu ulobo u va̱, a̱vu wu kasa tsu na agadu a na A̱sula̱ a ca ntsu.&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />&lt;&lt;Waru gogo aagbashi a̱ wu a damma ta̱, &lt;Lyawa adanshi a zagbain va̱ mogono ma̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ mu na̱ wivuwun, adama a na zagbain va̱ mogono ma̱ ta̱ tsa malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱ ma na maa gura kakasa isa'ani ni iwuya. Lyawa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 19:27.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Ɗaɗa mogono ma dammai ka'a, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri she vu soko mu ko ili i ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na mee ece wu wan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">A̱vu ka'a u damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa zagbain va̱ mogono ma yuwan adanshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Ɗaɗa we ece niyi, &lt;&lt;Ko ukere wa Yowab u ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a adanshi a̱ wu a nda suru?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">A̱vu ka'a u usu, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ na̱ a̱vu, ununa vu dammai ne ɗaɗa zagbain va̱ mogono. Ee, aagbashi a̱ wu Yowab ɗa zuwa numu n yuwain ne. A̱yi ɗa waru u zuwai idanshi i nda o una̱ wa aagbashi a̱ wu. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Aagbashi a̱ wu Yowab yuwan ta̱ ne tsa̱ra̱ u vadala ili i na yaa farasa gogo. Zagbain va̱ ta̱ nu ugbozu tsa malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱, waru u ta̱ nu urevu wi ili i na yaa farasa suru a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Ɗaɗa mogono ma dammai Yowab, &lt;&lt;To, n usu ta̱, wala vu 'ya̱wa̱ vu ta̱wa̱ na̱ molobo mo ndolo Absalom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />A̱vu Yowab kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to nu urewesu wa̱ yi e tyo e iɗa, reve u zuwaa mogono aba'un. A̱vu waru Yowab dammisa, &lt;&lt;Ana'an aagbashi a̱ wu a̱ tsura̱ ta̱ isa'ani uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu zagbain va̱ mogono, adama a na vu usu ta̱ ipati ya aagbashi a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Reve Yowab ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Geshu a̱vu u ta̱wa̱to Absalom Urishelima. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Amma a̱vu mogono ma damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ yi, she u ta̱wa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱ wan.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Absalom ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ yi agba we ene urewesu u mogono shi.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Absalom lapula ta̱ nden ma̱ yi na̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />A̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila suru babu za na aa cuwusa ulobonu tsa Absalom. Diga a apata a ana a̱ tyo a aaci babu ili i na ee isulaa yi. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Mantsa ma na suru u yuwain ipuna, adama a na o ukosu wa aa'wan suru u tsu puna̱ ta̱ aaci a̱ yi adama a na a̱nji'i a tsu yuwan yi ta̱ ume, reve u rito ume wa̱ a̱nji'i, ume wa̱ a̱nji'i u tsu la'a ta̱ kilo re o uritowu u tsugono.<verse eid="2SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Absalom matsan ta̱ olobo a ta'atsu nu usheli u ta̱ za na a̱ tsu ɗe Tamar, u da̱na̱ ta̱ ulobonu lon.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Absalom yuwan ta̱ a'wan e re a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, agba we ene urewesu u mogono shi. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Avu Absalom lyungu e ɗe Yowab, adama u lyungu yi uba̱ta̱ u mogono, amma Yowab 'yuwan ta̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi. A̱vu u lyunguwisa̱ mantsa me ire, amma Yowab 'yuwan ta̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Reve u damma agbashi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱i, uɗuma̱ wa Yowab u ta̱ zuzu na̱ za va̱, u ta̱ na̱ yitabo ɗe 'ya̱wa̱i i daɓa yi akina.&gt;&gt; Reve agbashi a Absalom a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a daɓa uɗuma̱'a̱ akina.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />A̱vu Yowab 'ya̱wa̱ o u'wa wa Absalom reve we ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai agbashi a̱ wu a daɓai uɗuma̱ u va̱ akina?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Reve Absalom usu yi, &lt;&lt;Adama a na n lyunguwa̱ wu ta̱ na adanshi, &lt;Ta̱wa̱, tsa̱ra̱ n lyungu wu uba̱ta̱ u mogono, ve ece, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai n ta̱wa̱i diga Geshu? U shi ta̱ a la'aa mu n da̱na̱ ɗe.&gt;&gt; Gogo lyawa n 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n mo mogono, na̱ n ri nu unusu wi ili i ro, wu una mu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Ɗaɗa Yowab 'ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ u mogono reve u damma yi ili i na Absalom dammai. Reve mogono ma̱ lyungu e ɗe Absalom, a̱vu u ta̱wa̱ u kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi a̱ tyo e iɗa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n mo mogono. Ɗaɗa mogono ma katalai Absalom.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Absalom 'ya̱sa̱a̱n ta̱ Da̱wuda aci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi, reve Absalom zamiya aciya̱yi keke vi ido ni ido oɓolo na̱ a̱soja kupoton aza a na a̱a̱ ka̱ra̱ elime a̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Absalom tsu 'yon ta̱ na̱ wasasa a̱vu wi isawan o ure u na wee tyo o una̱ntsu u lyuci. Mantsa ma na za ro ta̱wa̱yi ni ili i na ya̱a̱ ɓa̱la̱ yi, waru u ta̱ na adanshi a na wa̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ mogono adama o uge'etosu, Absalom tsu ɗe ta̱ vuma'a reve we ece yi, &lt;&lt;A̱ lyuci ne ɗa vu uta̱i?&gt;&gt; Nu u usu yi, &lt;&lt;Aagbashi a̱ wu o uta̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo u ro wa aza a Isra'ila,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />reve Absalom damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, adanshi a̱ wu a̱ tu ulobonu na̱ mejege, amma mogono ma zuwa lo za na aa zuwaa wu atsuvu shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Absalom tsu da̱shi ta̱ damma, &lt;&lt;A damma a katala mu ta̱ mo o'wo za vu uge'etosu e iɗa i nda, n na̱ za na ri ni ili i na ya̱a̱ ɓa̱la̱ yi suru ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱, n ta yuwaan yi uge'etosu wa amayun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Waru mantsa ma na suru za ro rawai a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi u kingyoi, reve u canana ukere wa̱ yi u 'ya̱sa̱n yi a̱vu u katala yi. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Tsundolo tsa ɗa Absalom yuwusayin aza a Isra'ila suru a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ u mogono adama o uge'etosu. Ne ɗa Absalom pura̱i ugbozu wa aza a Isra'ila suru.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Ana a yuwain a'wan a̱ na̱shi, reve Absalom damma mogono, &lt;&lt;N te ipati ya̱ wu vu lyawa mu n 'ya̱wa̱ Heburon adama n shiton akucunu a na n yuwain na̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />A mantsa ma na aagbashi a̱ wu a̱ da̱na̱i Geshu e iɗa ya Suriya, n yuwan ta̱ akucunu n damma, &lt;N na̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ mu Urishelima, n ta yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Reve mogono ma damma yi, &lt;&lt;To, ka̱ra̱ na asuvu nden.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Absalom 'yon u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Heburon.<verse eid="2SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />A̱vu Absalom lyungu nlingata usokowu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ o gundo va Isra'ila suru, a dansa, &lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na yu uwwai wivulu wa aavana, a̱vu i damma, &lt;Absalom wo o'wo ta̱ mogono ma Isra'ila a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci va̱ Heburon!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />A mantsa ma na Absalom uta̱i diga Urishelima a̱ tyo Heburon, ama ukpakure (200) ɗa o toni ni yi. U banu le ta̱ reve a̱ kuru yi agba na amayun e reve ili i na Absalom ri e ifoɓi i mayan shi. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />A mantsa ma na Absalom aa ca kucci, reve u lyungu a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci va̱ Gilo a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ yi na̱ Ahitofe vuma va̱ Gilo za na tsu casu Da̱wuda mogono a̱sa̱la̱. Ne ɗa ifoɓi yu u'ya̱sun wa aaci'i u yuwain ucira, reve aza a na oo tono Absalom a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ da̱shishi a̱bunda̱.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda suma ta̱ diga Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Reve malingata ma ta̱wa̱ u damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Okolo a ama a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Absalom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma azagbain a̱yi a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ yi pe Urishelima suru, &lt;&lt;'Yoyin, tsu sumai! Na̱ ne ɗa shi ko za a la'a e ekere a Absalom shi. Tsu ciga tsu 'yuwan tsu ga̱da̱ra̱ tsu sumai, ta̱wa̱ Absalom ta̱wa̱ gogo u cina tsu pa u yuwan tsu ulungusu wan, waru wu una lyuci'i na̱ matsun me pe'eni wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Reve azagbain o mogono a̱ usu a damma, &lt;&lt;Amayun, agbashi a̱ wu a̱ tu ufoɓu a yuwan ili i na zagbain mogono ma dammai suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Ɗaɗa mogono mo uta̱i na ama o u'wa wa̱ yi suru o tonoi, amma u lyawa ta̱ pe a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en kupa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ma̱ci nge'e'en aza na a̱a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ ukobu na akapi a linga vu u'wa'a.<verse eid="2SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Ana mogono oɓolo na a ama a̱yi suru e remei ure u na a lyawa lyuci'i, reve e isawan o u'wa wu ukosu. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />A̱vu azagbain a̱yi a uwa elime a̱yi suru, na aza a Keretiya na aza a Feletiya suru, na ama ukpakuta̱li (600) aza a na o toni niyi diga Gat suru, a̱vu a uwa elime o mogono.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda na̱ Itai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Reve mogono ma damma Itai vuma va Gat, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye a̱vu fo voo tono tsu? Ka̱mba̱ vu da̱nu na̱ mogono Absalom mogono ma sa'avu. Adama a na a̱vu mocin ɗa za na a tarai diga uba̱ta̱ o uvon e iɗa ya̱ a̱ wu. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Yon yon nda ɗa vu ta̱wa̱i. To cine tsa ɗa maa zuwa wu vu reme igaru oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu ana'an ana'an, agba a̱mu n reve uba̱ta̱ u na ma̱a̱ tyo shi? Ka̱mba̱ vu gere oɓolo na̱ a̱soja a̱ lyuci va̱ wu. Lyawa A̱sulazuva o roco wu icigi ya amayun ni isa'ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Amma reve Itai usu mogono'o, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, na̱ wuma wa̱ wu, zagbain va̱ mogono, uba̱ta̱ u na zagbain va̱ mogono ma̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ko a̱ kuwa̱ ko a yuwan wuma ɗe, ɗe ɗa fo aagbashi a̱ wu a̱a̱ tyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Reve Da̱wuda damma Itai, &lt;&lt;Wala vu uwa elime.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Itai vuma va Gat uwai elime na ama a̱yi suru oɓolo na aza na a̱ ri oɓolo n a̱yi.<verse eid="2SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Reve ama e iɗa'a suru o ɓosho na̱ yorori lon a mantsa ma na mogono oɓolo na ama a̱yi a̱ ri a̱ ma̱ka̱ra̱. Mogono oɓolo na ama a̱yi a pasa ta̱ Uka̱ri wa̱ Kidron, suru nle a saɓa ta̱ a̱ tyo o upasu wu ure wa̱ a̱tsumona a na e memere ma Urishelima nu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Saduku da̱na̱ ta̱ lo fo, waru suru nan Levi a na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ utanuwu na Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱. Reve a cu'wan akpati'i e iɗa, reve Abiyata ganu ca kucci, hali she na ama'a o kotoi mota̱ diga a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i suru.<verse eid="2SA 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />A̱vu mogono ma damma Saduku, &lt;&lt;Tara Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱'a̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci. Na̱ n tsura̱ isa'ani uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, u ta̱ ka̱mba̱to mu a̱vu u lyawa me ene yi, nu uba̱ta̱ wu nden ma̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Amma nu u damma, &lt;Mu uwwa uyo'o wa̱ wu shi,&gt; to, n tu ufoɓu, lyawa u yuwan na̱ a̱mu ili i na i lobono niyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Reve mogono ma lyuwa elime na adanshi na̱ Saduku ganu, &lt;&lt;A̱vu za yindi ɗa shi? Ka̱mba̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci na asuvu nden, oɓolo na̱ Ahima'az ulobo wa̱ wu, oɓolo na̱ Abiyata nu ulobo wa̱ yi Jonata. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Agba a̱mu n to puro ɗu o upasata wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu a̱tsumona, hali she na̱ n tsura̱ ikaka diga ya̱'a̱ a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Reve Saduku na̱ Abiyata a̱ ka̱mba̱to Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ Urishelima reve a̱ da̱nu ɗe.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda na̱ Hushai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Amma Da̱wuda kumba ta̱ Masasan ma̱ Zetun, nu u shosuyin a̱yi a makumba agawan a mmalu babu atan, aaci a̱yi waru wupalu adama a̱tsumola̱ngu. A̱vu ama a na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a pala fo aci e le, a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a makumba, e mesun ele a kumbusa. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />A̱vu a damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Ahitofe fo ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ aza a na oo ɓoloso aci na̱ Absalom.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda yuwain avasa, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva n pati wu ta̱ vu ka̱mbuwa̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a Ahitofe ili i tsulo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Ana Da̱wuda kumbai a̱ ncilecile, uba̱ta̱ u na ama a tsu yuwusaan A̱sula̱ a̱ga̱nda̱, she gba nlo Hushai vuma va Arki ta̱wa̱ u ga'aton yi na akari a̱ a̱tugu na̱ ma̱buta̱ a aaci a̱yi adama a̱tsumola̱ngu. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma yi, &lt;&lt;Na̱ vu kuru mu vu to o'wo mu itana. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Amma na̱ vu ka̱mba̱ a̱ lyuci vu damma Absalom, &lt;Mogono n to o'wo aagbashi a̱ wu, a̱mu aagbashi a dada va̱ wu ɗa n da̱na̱i nu ufaru, amma gogo n to o'wo aagbashi a̱ wu.&gt; Na̱ vu yuwan tsundolo vu ta kamba mu vu lungusa̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a Ahitofe. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Ashe nan ganu o ndolo Saduku na̱ Abiyata e ɗe na̱ a̱vu shi? To, vu damma le suru ili i na vu uwwai o ukobu u tsugono'o. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />A̱yi ɗa nda olobo e re e le o to oɓolo ne ele ɗe, Ahima'az ulobo wa̱ Saduku, na̱ Jonata ulobo wa Abiyata. Suru ili i na vu uwwai, vu lyungu le a̱ ta̱wa̱ a damma mu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Ne ɗa Hushai i'utsa̱ ya̱ Da̱wuda ka̱mba̱i Urishelima a mantsa ma na Absalom ri a ma'uwaa ma̱ lyuci'i.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Ziba ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ Da̱wuda na̱ ne'en</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Mantsa ma na Da̱wuda mogono pasai ncilecile n masasan wa'a, she gba lo Ziba aagbashi a̱ Mefiboshe, o purosu tsa̱ra̱ a ga'asan. Ziba ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ na̱ nloli n re utanuwu na akpatali opopofu ukpakure (200), no ogbodolu a̱ muwun n ina̱bi o u'yewu ukpaku (100), nu umatsun u muwun mu ɗanga ukpaku (100), na̱ tsa̱n vu ukwan masayan ma̱ ina̱bi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 9:9-10; 2 Sam 19:24.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Reve mogono Da̱wuda ece Ziba, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu ta̱wa̱i ni itana i nda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">A̱vu Ziba usu yi, &lt;&lt;N ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na̱ nloli adama a̱za̱ o u'wa o mogono a kumba. Opopofu na̱ muwun mu ɗanga waru tsa̱ra̱ ama a tama. Masayan waru tsa̱ra̱ aza na a̱ kuna̱i a̱tsumona o sowo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Reve mogono me ece yi, &lt;&lt;A̱ te ɗa Mefiboshe mawun ma tsukaya ma zagbain va̱ wu Shawulu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">A̱vu Ziba usu yi, &lt;&lt;U ta̱ ɗe Urishelima, adama a na u ta yuwusan majiyan, &lt;Ana'an u'wa wa Isra'ila u ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ mu tsugono tsa akaya va̱ Shawulu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 19:26-27.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Reve Da̱wuda damma Ziba, &lt;&lt;Suru ili i na i ri za va Mefiboshe, wo o'wo ta̱ za va̱ wu ana'an nda.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">A̱vu Ziba damma, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu ujima n kingyo ta̱ na̱ a̱lu a̱ va̱ e iɗa, lyawa n tsura̱ isa'ani uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu zagbain va̱ mogono kuci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimeyi yuwan ta̱ Da̱wuda una̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Ana Da̱wuda mogono rawai a̱ lyuci va̱ Bahurim, a̱vu vuma ro za na ri umatsun uta̱ na̱ Shawulu, za na ri na aala Shimeyi ulobo wa Gera wu uta̱ u ka̱ra̱ a yuwusan a̱yi una̱. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />A̱vu Shimeyi reme mavara ma̱ Da̱wuda na azagbain a na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱yi suru na atali, oɓolo na̱ a̱soja a na a gurai uvon suru a na a̱ da̱na̱i uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimeyi da̱na̱ ta̱ a yuwusaan Da̱wuda una̱ a dansa, &lt;&lt;Uta̱, uta̱, a̱vu za wocosu wu mpasa, vuma vama! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />A̱sulazuva a tsupaa ta̱ suru alaki a mpasa mu u'wa wa Shawulu, za na vu yuwain tsugono o una̱ wa̱ a̱yi, agba gogo A̱sulazuva a ca ta̱ tsugono'o uba̱ta̱ o ulobo wa̱ wu Absalom. Ka̱lyuwa̱ gogo meleshe ma ta aaci a̱ wu adama a na a̱vu za wocosu wu mpasa n ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />A̱vu Abishai za na mma va̱ yi ɗa Zeruya damma mogono, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu lyawai a̱kwa̱kwa̱ a̱ musa̱n ma nda a yuwusan zagbain va̱ mogono una̱? Lyawa m pasa n 'ya̱wa̱ n koɗo aaci a̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Amma mogono ma damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i bura numu na̱ a̱ɗu, olobo a Zeruya? Na̱ waa yuwusan una̱ adama a na A̱sulazuva a damma niyi, &lt;Yuwaan Da̱wuda una̱,&gt; za ne ɗa aa damma, &lt;Nye i zuwai vu yuwain ne?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />A̱vu waru Da̱wuda damma Abishai na azagbain a̱yi suru, &lt;&lt;Hali na wo o'woi ulobo wa̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ a̱ va̱ u ciga ta̱ na wo una mu, to bele vuma va Banyami ndolo! Lyawa niyi u lyuwa elime na̱ mayan mo una̱'a̱, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ɗa a damma niyi u yuwan ne. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />U ta gura wo o'wo A̱sulazuva a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na n ri pe, waru u tsupaa mu ni isa'ani adama o una̱ u na Shimeyi yuwan numu ana'an.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda na ama a̱yi a lyuwai elime na̱ mmalu o ure, Shimeyi gba a mmalu o upasu uta̱ u masasan nu u yuwusaan yi Da̱wuda una̱, na̱ wu vuvarasa niyi na atali, nu u tsuwusa̱a̱n niyi ma̱buta̱. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Mogono na ama a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi suru a rawa ta̱ o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu ukunu. Ɗe ɗa e ivuwain.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hushai ga'an ta̱ na̱ Absalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Ele lo reve Absalom na ama a Isra'ila aza a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi suru a uwa Urishelima. Ahitofe fo u da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Mantsa ma na Hushai vuma va Arki, i'utsa̱ ya̱ Da̱wuda i rawai uba̱ta̱ wa Absalom, reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima, mogono! Wuma wa̱ wu u jima, mogono!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />A̱vu Absalom ece Hushai, &lt;&lt;Icigi ya amayun i na vo rocosu i'utsa̱ ya̱ wu Da̱wuda ɗaɗa nda'a? Nye i zuwai vu toniyi i'utsa̱ ya̱ wu u shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />A̱vu Hushai usu yi, &lt;&lt;Ne ɗa shi, a̱mu n ta kurusu za na A̱sulazuva a ɗangulai, na̱ za na ama a nda na̱ aza a Isra'ila a ɗangulai suru. A̱yi ɗa n ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Babu na̱ a̱yi ndolo, jene ɗa u lobonoi n yuwaan tsugbashi u ka̱ra̱i ulobo wa̱ yi? Cine n lingayi dada va̱ wu, ne ɗa maa lingaa wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Reve Absalom vadaluwa u damma Ahitofe, &lt;&lt;Ca tsu a̱sa̱la̱ a̱ wu. Nye i ɗa tsaa yuwan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Reve Ahitofe usu yi, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu von na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en a na dada va̱ wu lyawai a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ ukobu na akapi a linga vu u'wa'a. Ne ɗa suru ama a Isra'ila e reve a na a̱vu na̱ dada va̱ wu i ri a muwwulai shi. Za ndolo ta̱ da̱shi ca aza a na a̱ kurusu wu ucira.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Reve o foɓoo Absalom oogodo zuva vu ukwa̱'a̱ wu ukobu u tsugono, a̱vu Absalom uwa u von na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en a dada va̱ yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma aza a Isra'ila suru.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 12:11-12.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Suru a̱sa̱la̱ a na Ahitofe casu nle a mantsa mo ndolo wo o'wo ta̱ she damma udammu wa̱ A̱sula̱ a ɗa. Ne tsundolo tsa ɗa Da̱wuda na̱ Absalom a̱ usuyi a̱sa̱la̱ a Ahitofe.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Hushai wawa ta̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Ahitofe damma ta̱ Absalom, &lt;&lt;Lyawa n ɗangula ama ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa ure (12,000), tsa̱ra̱ tsu saɓa Da̱wuda na ayin a nda. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />N ta̱ riya̱a̱ yi nu uvon mantsa ma na u kuna̱i waru u ta̱ka̱lyuwa̱i. N ta ca yi wovon lon hali ama a̱yi e bete'we suru a lyawa yi. Mogono ma ɗa goon moo una. <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />N ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ wu na a ama'a suru cine ama'a she o toni Da̱wuda, vuma na va zama vu una, akapi a ama'a gba a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ gbaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />A̱sa̱la̱ a nda o yo'onoto ta̱ Absalom okolo oɓolo na̱ mbara ma a Isra'ila suru.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱sa̱la̱ a Hushai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Amma Absalom damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Ɗeyi Hushai za va Arki, a̱yi fo tsu uwwa a̱sa̱la̱ a̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Ana Hushai ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi, reve Absalom damma, &lt;&lt;Apa a̱sa̱la̱ a na Ahitofe cayi. Tsu yuwan ili i na u dammai? Na̱ ne ɗa gba shi, vu damma tsu majiyan ma̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />A̱vu Hushai damma Absalom, &lt;&lt;A̱sa̱la̱ a na Ahitofe ca yi a mantsa ma nda ma̱ ri ulobonu shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />A̱vu Hushai dammisa, &lt;&lt;Vu reve ta̱ a na dada va̱ wu na ama a̱yi a gura ta̱ uvon lon. A̱ tu usuɗuwu cine vu revei nama gbain vu una na a̱ tsu ɗe biya na a usai muwun. Suru na̱ ne, dada va̱ wu gura ta̱ uvon a̱bunda̱ lon, u tsa asa oɓolo na̱ a̱soja na ayin shi. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Ko gogo u ta̱ ɗe upa'awun a̱a̱bunu ko uba̱ta̱ u ro. Na̱ waa fara riya̱a̱ ama a̱ ɗu nu uvon, a̱vu a̱za̱ ro a̱ kuwa̱ za na uwwa niyi suru ta damma, &lt;O una ta̱ a̱za̱ o uvon a na oo tono Absalom na̱ a̱bunda̱.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Ili i nda i ta zuwa soja na ri nu ukadu za na ri no okolo cu'un vu kamu wu da'wan lon. Adama a na vuma suru a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila u reve ta̱ a na dada va̱ wu vali vu ucira ɗa na gurai uvon lon, waru a̱soja a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a̱ ta̱ nu ukadu.<verse eid="2SA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo, n ta casu a̱sa̱la̱. Lyawa o ɓoloto aza a Isra'ila suru, diga upasu wu ugana u lyuci wa Dan a̱ tyo upasu wu uyagi u lyuci wa Biyasheba a̱bunda̱ ele a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ cine vu revei wuyun ma̱ nge'en m mala. A̱vu, a̱vu na aciya̱wu vu rono le aaɗanga uba̱ta̱ wu uvo'on. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Tsu ta̱ riya̱a̱ Da̱wuda nu uvon uba̱ta̱ u na tsu cina niyi suru, a̱vu tsu riya̱a̱ yi nu uvon ba̱ta̱ biti cine vu revei a'iza a̱ tsu kpa̱to iɗa. Ko a̱yi ko za na ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi babu za na tsaa lyawa wuma. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Nu u suma a uwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci na ri uka̱nda̱ruwu nu ukari, a̱soja a Isra'ila suru a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ na amunga, o to rono atali o uɓaɓu suru a̱ tyo a̱tsuma̱ o uka̱ri, babu matali ma na aa lyawa zuva vu za va̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Absalom na ama a Isra'ila suru a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱sa̱la̱ a Hushai za va Arki la'a ta̱ za na Ahitofe ta̱wa̱yi.&gt;&gt; Adama a na A̱sulazuva o foɓo ta̱ u lungusa̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a sa'ani a Ahitofe adama u ta̱wa̱a̱ Absalom na addama.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Hushai damma ta̱ Saduku na̱ Abiyata nan ganu, &lt;&lt;Apa cu'un va̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a na Ahitofe cayi Absalom na̱ mbara ma a Isra'ila. Amma a̱mu gba apa cu'un va̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a na n cayi. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />I jika̱ i lyunguwa̱a̱ Da̱wuda mogono i damma yi, &lt;She vaa asa o upasata wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu wa̱ a̱tsumona wan, amma ko cine vaa yuwan vu jika̱ vu pasa. Na̱ vu yuwan ne shi a̱ ta̱ reme wu a̱vu o una wu oɓolo na aza a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱vu suru.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Jonata oɓolo na̱ Ahima'az a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ e ipiri a̱ lyusu mini wa̱ En Roge. A̱ tsu lyungu ta̱ aagbashi ka ro adama u damma le ili i na yaa farasa, reve ele a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a damma Da̱wuda mogono ili i na i ri a mmalu, adama ta̱wa̱ e ene le a ma'uwaa ma̱ lyuci'i wan. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Amma ulobo u ro we ene ta̱ Jonata oɓolo na̱ Ahima'az, ɗaɗa u dammai Absalom. Adama o ndolo reve Ahima'az na̱ Jonata a̱ jika̱ a̱ 'yon a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a uwa o u'wa u vuma ro a̱ lyuci va Bahurim. Vuma'a gba u ta̱ no oko'o a agalaci o u'wa wa̱ yi, reve a uwa pe a pa'an. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />A̱vu ka vuma'a tara ikpa̱ta̱tsu u kpa̱to una̱ wo oko'o'o. Reve u ta̱wa̱ ni ishina u 'yetsu ɗe. Reve u kacara uba̱ta̱ suru cine za a gura jiyan ili i ro i ta̱ pe shi.<verse eid="2SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Ana a̱soja a Absalom a̱ ta̱wa̱i a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa uba̱ta̱ wu ka'a, reve e ece yi, &lt;&lt;Te ɗa Ahima'az na̱ Jonata?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Reve ka u usu le, &lt;&lt;A pasa ta̱ uka̱ri a̱ ka̱ra̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">A̱soja'a a zami le ta̱ agba a̱ tsura̱ le shi, ɗaɗa a̱ ka̱mba̱i a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima.<verse eid="2SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Ana a̱soja a Absalom a̱ ka̱ra̱i, ɗaɗa Ahima'az na̱ Jonata o uta̱i a̱tsuma̱ o oko'o'o reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u na mogono Da̱wuda ri. Reve a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Jika̱ vu pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu'u. Adama a na apa cu'un va̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a na Ahitofe cayi a aci a̱ wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu Da̱wuda na ama a̱yi a̱ 'yon a fara a pasasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu suru. Kafu usana u tawa babu vuma na buwai babu na u pasai uɗolu u ndolo.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ana Ahitofe revei a 'yuwan ta̱ a̱ kuru a̱sa̱la̱ a̱yi, reve u foɓo mololi ma̱ yi u kumba, u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi a̱ lyuci va̱ a̱yi. Ana u foɓoi u'wa wa̱ yi reve wu nla̱ aciya̱yi zuva hali u kuwa̱. Reve a̱ ciɗo yi a aason a dada va̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci va Mahanayim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />A̱vu Da̱wuda ka̱ra̱ a̱tyo a lyuci va Mahanayim. Reve Absalom pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu oɓolo na̱ a̱soja a Isra'ila suru. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Absalom zuwa ta̱ Amasa wo o'wo yali ya̱ a̱ a̱soja o una̱ wa Yowab. Amasa ulobo wa Itara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itara: Waru e revei ta̱ na aala fo &lt;&lt;Jeta.&gt;&gt;</char></note> u ɗa vuma va Isra'ila za na zuwai Abigel usheli wa Nahash za na mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ a̱yi ma ɗa Zeruya mma va Yowab. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Aza a Isra'ila na̱ Absalom a̱ va̱la̱ ta̱ e iɗa ya Giliyadu.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />A mantsa ma na Da̱wuda rawai Mahanayim reve Shobi ulobo wa Nahash vuma va Raba vi iɗa ya Amon na̱ Maki ulobo wa Amiyel va̱ Lodeba na̱ Bazilai vu upasu wa Giliyadu vuma va Rogelim, <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ni itana i nda: A̱ga̱da̱ na akwanu na̱ mpondo na̱ oroci a yitabo na̱ yitabo ni yira na̱ ishina yu uzuwun na aluba na aluba e nre'on, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />waru a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ni ishiki na̱ maani ma̱ a̱ga̱ɓa̱ ni mgbele na̱ wara vi inan adama Da̱wuda na̱ a̱soja a̱yi a tama. Adama a na a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱soja'a a uwa ta̱ ambulu na akuli nu ukunu a̱ a̱tsumona.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Ukwa̱ wa Absalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Da̱wuda ɓoloto ta̱ a̱soja a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, reve u zuwa le nan yali a na a̱ shi aci o oɓolo oɓolo a̱ a̱soja, na̱ nan yali vu ukpakukupa na̱ a̱za̱ o ukpaku. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />A̱vu Da̱wuda lyungu a̱soja oɓolo a ta'atsu. Oɓolo a̱ ta̱ za̱la̱ tsugbain tsa̱ Yowab. Oɓolo a̱ ta̱ waru za̱la̱ tsugbain tsa Abishai mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ Yowab ulobo wa Zeruya. Za ta̱ waru za̱la̱ tsugbain tsa Itai vuma va Gat. Ɗaɗa mogono ma dammai o oɓolo a̱soja'a, &lt;&lt;A̱mu na aciya̱va̱ n ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu uba̱ta̱ wu uvo'on.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Reve o oɓolo a̱soja'a a damma, &lt;&lt;Voo uta̱ ɗe shi! Adama a na ko na̱ shi tsu suma diga uba̱ta̱ wu uvo'on, ili ya̱ ɓa̱li yaa ama a Absalom shi. Ko na̱ shi uɓatsulai u tsu u kuwa̱ wa̱a̱ ɓa̱la̱ le shi. Amma a̱vu vu rawa ta̱ o una̱ wa ama ukpakukupa kupa u tsu (10,000). Adama o ndolo u ta la'a vu da̱nu a̱ lyuci vu lyunguwa̱ tsu ni ikambi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Ɗaɗa mogono ma̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;N ta yuwan suru cine ye enei u lobonoi.&gt;&gt; Reve mogono me e isawan zuzu nu una̱ntsu u lyuci mantsa ma na o oɓolo a̱soja suru a̱ ri a̱ ma̱ka̱ra̱ vu ukpakukupa na̱ ukpaku. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />A̱vu mogono ma damma Yowab na̱ Abishai na̱ Itai, &lt;&lt;I kuru ben na̱ molobo mo ndolo Absalom adama a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt; Waru suru a̱soja a uwwa ta̱ mantsa ma na mogono ma dammai nan yali yo oɓolo a a̱soja'a, adama a Absalom.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />A̱vu a̱soja a̱ Da̱wuda o uta̱ a̱ tyo a agalaci reve a yuwan uvon na̱ a̱soja a Isra'ila. A yuwan ta̱ uvo'on a̱ a̱a̱rumbu a Ifiramu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Ɗe ɗa a̱soja a̱ Da̱wuda a lyuwai a̱soja a Isra'ila nu uvon, a lamba ta̱ ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ lon. O una ta̱ ama ukpakukupa ushin (20,000) o urana u ndolo. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Uvon u baza ta̱ uba̱ta̱ suru upasu wi iɗa'a. Ama a na a̱a̱rumbu'u a lyuwai a la'a ta̱ aza a na o unai na̱ matsun me pe'eni.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Babu ufaru reve Absalom ga'an na̱ a̱soja a̱ Da̱wuda. Absalom gba u da̱na̱ ta̱ e ilaɗi o mololi mo do va̱ a̱yi, reve mololi mo do'o ma uwa za̱la̱ ve eten o uɗanga u gbain a̱vu ete'en u reme a̱nji a Absalom, amma mololi mo do ma na u da̱na̱i ukumbu u ka̱ra̱ ta̱, reve u lyawa yi lo a̱ wuta̱lyuwusa̱.<verse eid="2SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Ana za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱soja a̱ Da̱wuda enei Absalom, a̱vu u damma Yowab, &lt;&lt;Me ene ta̱ Absalom a̱ wuta̱lyuwusa̱ zuva ve eten o uɗanga u gbain.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Reve Yowab damma vuma'a, &lt;&lt;Ana ve ne niyi, nye i putsaa nuwu a na vo o unai? N shi ta̱ a ca wu ikebe azurufa kupa na̱ gbakala tsugbain.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Amma vuma'a u usu yi ta̱ u damma, &lt;&lt;Ko na adama ikebe i azurufa ukpakukupa (1,000) u ɗa vaa ca mu ma̱a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ukere u va̱ n ju'wa̱n ulobo u mogono shi. Adama a na a atsuvu a̱ tsu a ɗa mogono ma damma nuwu na̱ Abishai na̱ Itai, u damma, &lt;I yuwaan molobo mo ndolo Absalom mapari adama a̱ va̱.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Na̱ shi a damma n tara ta̱ alaki hali mu una yi, babu cine a shi a yuwan mogono me e reve shi. Waru a̱vu na aciya̱wu vu shi ta̱ a wasan mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />A̱vu Yowab damma, &lt;&lt;Ma̱a̱ lungusa̱ mantsa tsunda na̱ a̱vu shi.&gt;&gt; Reve u tara mbata aza a ta'atsu ne ekere a̱yi reve u sapa le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Absalom hali a̱ tyo o okolo a mantsa mo ndolo a̱yi ubuwu wuma a̱ wuta̱lyuwusa̱ zuva ve eten o uɗanga u gbain. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />A̱vu olobo kupa aza a na a guzusa̱a̱ Yowab itana yu uvon a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ Absalom, reve o koso unai hali u kuwa̱.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />A̱vu Yowab ivula̱ aavana, a̱vu oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a̱yi suru a lyawa a gbagbusa aza a Isra'ila, adama a na Yowab ɗe nle e isawan. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Reve a tara lipu va Absalom, a̱vu a vari yi pe a̱ a̱ka̱ri a̱ a̱ru'un a̱ a̱a̱rumbu, a̱vu a̱ pura̱ atali a̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ ciɗo yi ne ele. Avu aza a Isra'ila suru a suma a̱ ka̱mba̱ a 'wa le.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />A mantsa ma na Absalom da̱na̱i wuma u shuwa̱a̱ ta̱ aciya̱yi aatsura o Uka̱ri u Mogono a na a̱ ri n cuwusan na̱ a̱yi ɗe, adama a na u ta a majiyan, &lt;&lt;N ri nu ulobo u na a cuwan na aala a̱ va̱ shi.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa u cayi atsura'a aala a̱yi. Adama o ndolo a ɗa ee ɗesu yi Aatsura o Ucuwusan na̱ Absalom hali a cina ana'an.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda yuwan ta̱ nden n wirota̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Reve Ahima'az ulobo wa Saduku damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa n suma n 'ya̱wa̱ n damma mogono alabari a nda, ana A̱sulazuva a wawa yi ta̱ diga e ekere a n'yuwatan ma̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Reve Yowab damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗa va̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ vu damma mogono a na ulobo wa̱ a̱yi ukuwa̱i shi. Vu ta 'ya̱wa̱a̱ yi nu udammu urana u ro, amma gba ana'an shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Ɗaɗa Yowab dammai vuma va̱ Kush, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu damma mogono ili i na ve enei.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa za va Kush'i u kingyo yi nu urewesu wa̱ yi a̱tyo we e iɗa, reve u 'yon u ka̱ra̱ ni ilaɗi.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Reve Ahima'az ulobo wa Saduku da̱shi dammisa Yowab, &lt;&lt;Ko nye i ɗa yaa fara, lyawa mu n kuru a̱ca̱pa̱ a vuma va Kush'i.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">A̱vu Yowab usu yi, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye vu cigai vu 'ya̱wa̱, ulobo u va̱? Ka̱lyuwa̱ va̱ tsura̱ atsupu a̱tsuma̱ a alabari a nda shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Reve Ahima'az dammisa, &lt;&lt;Ko nye i ɗa yaa fara, n ta suma n kuru yi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">A̱vu Yowab usu yi, &lt;&lt;To, she vu suma!&gt;&gt; Reve Ahima'az suma u kuru ure u ro u na u ri o Uka̱ri wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu hali u la'asa za va Kush'i.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Da̱wuda gba u da̱na̱ ta̱ nden e memmere mo una̱ntsu wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ na̱ za va alanga. Ana za na a yuwusan ipiri zuva vu ukwa̱'a̱ wu una̱ntsu u lyuci ka̱ra̱i a rawa zuzu nu uɓaɓu u lyuci'i u 'ya̱sa̱in urewesu wa̱ yi, reve we ene vuma e ilaɗi a̱yi a̱ nde'en a̱ ta̱wa̱ le. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />A̱vu za vi ipiri'i u ɗe mogono reve u cuɗuwa yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Reve mogono ma̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Na̱ a̱yi ɗa u ri a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ nde'en, alabari a ɗa wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱.&gt;&gt; Reve vuma'a u ka̱ra̱ a rawusa zuzu lon. <verse eid="2SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />A̱vu za vi ipiri'i we enishe vuma ro e ilaɗi, a̱vu u ɗe za na ri uba̱ta̱ o una̱ntsu reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱ vuma ro e ilaɗi a̱ ta̱wa̱!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">A̱vu mogono ma damma,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">&lt;&lt;A̱yi nda fo alabari a ɗa wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />A̱vu za na a yuwusan ipiri zuva vu ukwa̱'a̱ wu una̱ntsu u lyuci'i u damma, &lt;&lt;N ta majiyan za vu ufaru nda'a she damma ilaɗi ya̱ Ahima'az ulobo wa Saduku u ɗa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">A̱vu mogono ma damma, &lt;&lt;Vuma va̱ a̱ɓula̱ ɗa, alabari a̱ sa'ani a ɗa wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Reve Ahima'az 'ya̱sa̱n uɗyo u damma mogono, &lt;&lt;Ili suru i ta̱ gbaga.&gt;&gt; Reve u kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi e iɗa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n mo mogono, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Za va aba'un ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu, za na wawa nuwu diga e ekere a aza a na a̱a̱ 'ya̱susa̱a̱n zagbain va̱ mogono aci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Reve mogono me ece yi, &lt;&lt;N damma molobo'o Absalom u ta̱ gbaga?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">A̱vu Ahima'az usu u damma, &lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na Yowab lyunguyi aagbashi o mogono oɓolo na̱ a̱mu, me ene ta̱ urupulu u gbain, amma n reve ko nye i ɗa shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Reve mogono ma damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mba̱ a̱ nge'en vu isawan pa nda.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa u ka̱mba̱i a̱ nge'en reve wi isawan kuci.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Ɗaɗa gba vuma va̱ Kush'i rawa shi a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa zagbain va̱ mogono ma̱ da̱na̱ nu urevu u na A̱sulazuva a wawa nuwu ana'an e ekere a aza a na a̱a̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n nuwu a aci suru!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Reve mogono me ecishe vuma va̱ Kush'i, &lt;&lt;N damma Absalom molobo'o u ta̱ gbaga?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Reve vuma va̱ Kush'i u usu yi, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sula̱ a zuwa n'yuwatan mu zagbain va̱ mogono na aza a na a̱a̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n nuwu aci na aa yuwaan nuwu iwuya suru a̱ kuwa̱ tso molobo mo ndolo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Reve okolo o mogono a̱ riya̱. Reve u kumba zuva a̱ tyo a aasula a na a̱ ri zuva vu una̱ntsu u lyuci, nu u shoyin a manlu a dansa, &lt;&lt;O'o ulobo u va̱ Absalom! O'o ulobo u va̱! O'o ulobo u va̱! Na̱ a̱ shi ma a damma a̱mu ɗa n kuwa̱i o una̱ wa̱ wu. O'o ulobo u va̱ Absalom! Ulobo u va̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Yowab ɓara ta̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />A̱vu a damma Yowab, &lt;&lt;Mogono ma̱ ta̱ mesun na̱ nden n wiruta̱ adama a Absalom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Ulyuwu wa aci a na a̱soja suru a yuwain a̱tsuma̱ o urana u ndolo a̱vu u ka̱mba̱ le a̱tsumola̱ngu, adama a na urana u ndolo a̱soja'a a uwwa ta̱ a na a dammai, &lt;&lt;Mogono ma ta̱ mesun na̱ nden n wiruta̱ adama o ulobo wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />A̱vu a̱soja a uwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci va Mahanayim urana u ndolo usokowu, cine a̱soja a tsu suma diga uba̱ta̱ o uvon, a̱vu a uwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i usokowu na̱ wono. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />A̱vu mogono ma̱ ɓa̱ru urewesu wa̱ yi a yisaali nu ucira u damma, &lt;&lt;O'o ulobo u va̱ Absalom! O'o ulobo u va̱, O'o ulobo u va̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />A̱vu Yowab uwa a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa u mogono a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ana'an nda vu ca ta̱ a̱soja a̱ wu wono suru, aza a na a wawai wuma wa̱ wu, na̱ wuma u muwun ma̱ wu olobo ne esheli na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ wu na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en a̱ wu fo. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Vu ciga ta̱ n'yuwatan ma̱ wu a̱vu vu 'yuwan aza a na a ciga nuwu. Vu roco ta̱ a alanga eteshe na a amayun ana'an nan yali ya̱ a̱soja na̱ a̱soja e le a̱ ri ili i ro ya̱'a̱ wu shi. Me ene ta̱ vu ta uwwa uyo'o a̱ shi a damma Absalom ta̱ lo wuma ana'an a̱vu a̱tsu suru tsu kuwa̱. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Gogo, vu uta̱ vu ca ama a̱ wu adanshi. N kucina ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva n na̱ vu uta̱ a alanga shi, babu vuma na a̱ da̱nu oɓolo na̱ a̱vu a̱tsuma̱ a ayin a nda. A̱yi nda u ta la'aa wu usa̱n lon na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na vu sowoi a mantsa ma na vu da̱na̱i o tsulolobo tsa̱ wu hali a cina ana'an.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />A̱vu mogono ma̱ 'yon ma̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ o una̱ntsu u lyuci, a̱vu u da̱nu. A mantsa ma na alabari a rawai uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱soja'a suru, &lt;&lt;Ana mogono ma̱ ta̱ ɗe nden uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi o una̱ntsu u lyuci,&gt;&gt; reve vuma suru u ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:8">Da̱wuda ka̱mba̱ ta̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Ele lo, reve ama a Isra'ila aza a na a̱ shi o toni yi Absalom a sumusa a̱ ka̱mba̱ a 'wa le. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />A̱tsuma̱ o gundo va Isra'ila suru a uwa ta̱ a yuwusan mawasan va̱ni le a dansa, &lt;&lt;Mogono Da̱wuda ɗa wawa ntsu diga e ekere a n'yuwatan n tsu, a̱yi ɗa waru u wawa ntsu diga e ekere a aza a Filistiya. Amma gogo gba a̱yi ɗa nda u sumai u lyawai iɗa'a adama u la'a e ekere a Absalom. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Absalom na tsu tsuwa̱n yi mani'in adama wo o'wo mogono ma̱ tsu ma̱ kuwa̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o uvon. Gogo adama a̱ nye a ɗa babu za na a yuwusan adanshi a na a̱a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ mogono Dawuda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Ana mogono Da̱wuda uwwai alabari a adanshi a na ama a Isra'ila aa dansa, a̱vu u lyungu ni ikaka uba̱ta̱ wa Saduku na̱ Abiyata nan ganu a̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;Ecee numu mbara ma Yahuda, &lt;Adama a̱ nye a ɗa wo o'wo a̱za̱ o ukosu a na ya̱a̱ ka̱mba̱to mogono o ukobu u tsugono tsa̱ yi, adama a na ili i na a dammai suru a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila u rawa ta̱ o ukobu atsuvu o mogono. <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />A̱ɗu muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun n va̱ n ɗa, lipu va̱ na̱ mpasa n va̱. Adama a̱ nye yoo o'wo a̱za̱ o ukosu a na ya̱a̱ ka̱mba̱to mu mogono?&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />A̱vu waru i damma Amasa, &lt;Ashe a̱vu lipu va̱ na̱ mpasa n va̱ n ɗa shi? Lyawa A̱sula̱ a ca mu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon na̱ vo o'wo yali ya̱ a̱soja a̱ va̱ o una̱ wa Yowab diga gogo hali acina ukosu u wuma wa̱ wu shi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />A̱vu Da̱wuda pura̱ okolo a ama a Yahuda suru she damma vuma ta̱. A̱vu a̱ lyunguwa̱a̱ mogono ni ikaka, &lt;&lt;Vu ka̱mba̱ a̱vu na̱ a̱soja a̱ wu suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />A̱vu mogono me reme ure adama u ka̱mba̱ Urishelima. Kafu u rawa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu, ɗaɗa a ama a Yahuda a̱ ta̱wa̱i Gilga adama a ga'aton yi a pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu oɓolo na̱ yi. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimeyi ulobo wa Gera vuma va Banyami diga a̱ lyuci va Bahurim jika̱ ta̱ ucipa̱ o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu oɓolo na ama a Yahuda adama u ga'aton Mogono Da̱wuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 16:5-13.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Shimeyi ta̱wa̱ ta̱ oɓolo na ali a Banyami ukpakukupa (1,000) na̱ Ziba aagbashi a Shawulu oɓolo no olobo a̱yi gendu na̱ agbashi ushin. A̱vu suru a̱ jika̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu adama a na a ga'asan na̱ mogono. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />A̱vu a pasa nu upasata wu uɗolu'u adama a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱to mogono nu u'wa wa̱ yi, waru a yuwan ili i na u cigai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:18">Da̱wuda roco ta̱ Shimeyi isa'ani</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">A mantsa ma na mogono mo foɓoi a na waa pasa, a̱vu Shimeyi ulobo wa Gera ta̱wa̱ u von ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ e iɗa elime a̱yi. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />A̱vu u damma mogono, &lt;&lt;N ta patishi wu zagbain va̱ mogono she vu ɓana unusu u va̱ a̱tsuma̱ o okolo a̱ wu wan. She vu cuwan nu unusu u na n yuwusaan nuwu a mantsa ma na vu sumai diga Urishelima wan. She vu zuwa yi o okolo wan ko ke'en. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Adama a na a̱mu aagbashi a̱ wu n reve ta̱ a na n yuwaan nuwu unusu. Agba apa a̱mu nda ana'an n ta̱wa̱i za vu ufaru vu u'wa wa̱ Isuhu na akapi a ama a Isra'ila adama n ga'an na̱ zagbain va̱ mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />A̱vu Abishai ulobo wa Zeruya usu u damma, &lt;&lt;Wuntsa ta̱ o una Shimeyi adama a na u yuwan wu ta̱ una̱ a̱vu na A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱a̱n yi mani'in.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Amma a̱vu Da̱wuda usu, &lt;&lt;Nye i bura nɗu na̱ a̱mu, a̱ɗu olobo a Zeruya? I ciga ta̱ a na yo o'o n'yuwatan n va̱ ana'an? Gogo n reve ta̱ a na a̱mu ɗa mogono ma Isra'ila, waru babu vuma va Isra'ila n na o una ana'an.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />A̱vu mogono ma damma Shimeyi, &lt;&lt;N kucina wu ta̱ o una wu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda roco ta̱ Mefiboshe isa'ani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Mefiboshe mawun ma tsukaya ma Shawulu fo cipa̱ ta̱ adama u ga'an na̱ mogono Da̱wuda. Mefiboshe shi u sa'a ana a̱yi shi, waru u shi u puna ntsuka̱ ma̱ yi shi, ko wu za̱'wa̱ a̱tugu a̱yi shi, diga urana u na mogono ma sumai hali mantsa ma na u ka̱mba̱i na asuvu nden.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24-26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 9:1-13; 16:1-4.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />A mantsa ma na u rawai diga Urishelima adama u ga'aton mogono, a̱vu mogono me ece yi, &lt;&lt;Mefiboshe, adama a̱ nye vu 'yuwain a̱ kuru mu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;Zagbain va̱ mogono, a̱mu a̱kutsuma̱ a ɗa. Aagbashi a̱ va̱ Ziba ɗa luluma̱ na̱ mu, adama a na n damma ta̱, &lt;Foɓo mu mololi adama a na mo toni mogono,&gt; amma a̱vu a̱yi u tara mololi u ka̱ra̱ u lyawa mu. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Amma u lungusa̱ ta̱ ala a aagbashi a̱ wu e ekere a zagbain va̱ mogono. Zagbain va̱ ta̱ tsa malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱, adama o ndolo vu yuwan na̱ a̱mu ili i na ve enei u lobono nuwu. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Amma na amayun ama o u'wa dada va̱ suru, wu ntsa ta̱ a̱ kuwa̱ diga e ekere a zagbain va̱ mogono, agba a̱vu vu ca ta̱ aagbashi a̱ wu uba̱ta̱ oɓolo na aza a na aa lyuwusa a apada a̱ wu. Adama o ndolo ucira u ne n ri na̱ a̱yi a na ma̱a̱ da̱shi yuwan ipati a̱ tyo e ekere o mogono?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />A̱vu mogono ma usu yi, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye va̱a̱ da̱shi yuwan adanshi waru? N damma ta̱ ɗe a̱vu na̱ Ziba i ne'eshen iɗa'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />A̱vu Mefiboshe usu mogono, &lt;&lt;Lyawa Ziba o'wo ni ili biti, a na wo o'woi zagbain va̱ mogono ma rawai o u'wa na asuvu nden.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda roco ta̱ Bazilai isa'ani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Reve fo Bazilai vuma va Giliyadu cipa̱ diga Rogelim adama u shewun mogono a pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 17:27-29.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Bazilai gba aabara a ɗa lon, vuma ɗa na da̱na̱i na a'wan kupakunla̱. U kamba ta̱ mogono na̱ a̱soja a̱yi ni ilyalya a mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i Mahanayim na̱ nden, adama a na u shi ta̱ nu utsuru lon. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />A̱vu mogono ma damma Bazilai, &lt;&lt;Pasa oɓolo na̱ a̱mu a̱ tyo Urishelima, n ta̱ gba a kamba a̱ wu ni ili i na vu cigai ɗe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Amma a̱vu Bazilai usu yi u damma, &lt;&lt;A'wan a yan a ɗa a buwa numu a wuma u va̱ a na maa gawan oɓolo na̱ mogono a̱ tyo Urishelima? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Gogo a̱mu ɗa nda a'wan kupakunla̱. N ta gura reve ili i na i ri ulobonu ni ili i na i ri ulobonu shi? Aagbashi a̱ wu a ta gura reve uyo'o wi ili i na u lyuwai ni ili i na u sowoi? N ta̱ da̱shi gura uwwa uɗyo wa ashipi wa ama ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci? Adama a̱ nye aagbashi a̱ wu oo o'wo uda̱shiyi wa addama e ekere a zagbain va̱ mogono? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Mogono, aagbashi a̱ wu a ta pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu oɓolo na̱ a̱vu, reve n da̱shi dasu wa wu wa'a. Amma nye zuwai mogono ma tsupa mu na̱ cu'un va atsupu a nda? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Yuwan ankuri lyawa aagbashi a̱ wu a̱ ka̱mba̱ adama n kuwa̱ a̱ lyuci va̱ zuzu na aason wa a mma va̱ na̱ dada va̱. Agba apa aagbashi a̱ wu Kimham lyawa u pasa u ka̱ra̱ oɓolo na̱ zagbain va̱ mogono. Waru vu yuwan na̱ a̱yi ili i na ve enei u lobono nuwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />A̱vu mogono ma damma, &lt;&lt;Kimham ta pasa oɓolo na̱ a̱mu, waru n ta yuwaan yi ili i na suru vu cigai. Waru ili i na suru vu cigai e ekere a̱ va̱ n ta yuwaan wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda oɓolo na ama'a suru a pasai Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu. Reve mogono ma katala Bazilai a̱vu u zuwaa yi aba'un, a̱vu Bazilai ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />A matsan ma na mogono ma pasai, waru a̱soja a Yahuda na akapi a̱soja a Isra'ila a̱ shewun yi ta̱, reve Da̱wuda ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Gilga, waru Kimham ka̱ra̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ama a Yahuda na aza a Isra'ila a yuwan ta̱ nwasanlai adama o mogono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />A̱vu ama a Isra'ila suru a̱ ta̱wusa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu ujima, adama a̱ nye a̱za̱ a̱ tsu, ama a Yahuda e iva̱ na̱ wu, reve apasa oɓolo na̱ a̱vu, nu u'wa wa̱ wu, oɓolo na ama a̱ wu a̱ tyo wu upasu u mavada mo Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />A̱vu ama a Yahuda suru a̱ usu ama a Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;Ili i na i zuwai tsu yuwain ne a̱ yi ɗa, adama a na mogono imaci i zuzu i tsu i ɗa. Adama a̱ nye i ri o upan adama o ndolo? Tsu lyuwa ta̱ ili i ro a̱tsuma̱ e ilyalya i mogono? Ko u ca tsu ta̱ une'e u ro?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />A̱vu ama a Isra'ila a̱ usu ama a Yahuda, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta̱ na̱ gundo kupa a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila, waru a̱ɗu za ta̱ ɗa. Adama o ndolo tsu ta̱ nu ucira ba̱ta̱ kupa a na tsa damma Da̱wuda mogono ma̱ tsu ma ɗa, a na a̱ɗu ya damma ne. To, adama a̱ nye ya̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ tsu ne esu a vama? Tsu reve ta̱ na amayun a̱tsu ɗa tsu fara yuwain adanshi a na tsa̱a̱ ka̱mba̱to mogono Da̱wuda a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a na wo o'wiso mogono ma̱ a̱tsu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Agba ama a Yahuda a̱ usu ta̱ nu usuɗuwu u na u la'ai akapi o gundo wa aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Sheba 'ya̱sa̱a̱n ta̱ Da̱wuda aci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />A yuwan ta̱ vuma vama ro a Gilga za na a tsu ɗe Sheba ulobo wa Bikiri o ugundo wa Banyami. A̱vu wi ivula̱ aavana ɗaɗa wo oruwoi u dammai,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 20:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">&lt;&lt;Tsu ri na akunda uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">tsu ri na agadu e ekere o ulobo wa̱ Yese shi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">A̱ɗu aza a Isra'ila, lyawa tsu ka̱mba̱ yi o ogodo a̱tsu!&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Ngo 12:16; 2 Alb 10:16.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />A̱vu ama a Isra'ila suru a lyawa Da̱wuda, a̱vu a vadala o toni Sheba ulobo wa Bikiri. Amma a̱vu ama a Yahuda a kaɓa mogono me le a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi diga o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu hali a rawa Urishelima.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />A mantsa ma na Da̱wuda rawai o ukobu wa̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, a̱vu u pura̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en kupa aza a na u shi u lyawai a na a̱a̱ da̱na̱ e idanasa ukobu'u na akapi a linga vu u'wa'a. A̱vu u zuwa le a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa u ro, na aza a na a̱a̱ da̱na̱ a̱ pirishi le. A̱vu u lyuwa elime a kambusa le ni ili i i na a cigai, amma u da̱shi von ne ele waru shi. Ne ɗa a̱ da̱nuyi utakatsuwu hali ukwisa̱ u le, reve a̱ da̱nu tsu nruna̱.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 16:22.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />A̱vu mogono ma damma Amasa, &lt;&lt;Ɓoloto wo mu a ama a Yahuda a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱ a̱tsuma̱ a rana ta'atsu, a̱vu fo vu ta̱wa̱ oɓolo ne ele.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Agba a na Amasa 'ya̱wa̱i u ɗe aza a Yahuda, u ka̱ra̱ ta̱ mantsa ma na mogono ma zuwaa niyi.<verse eid="2SA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma Abishai, &lt;&lt;Gogo Sheba ulobo wa Bikiri u ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ tsu na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ za na la'ai za va Absalom. Tara a̱soja a̱ va̱ vu saɓa yi, adama ta̱wa̱ u suma a̱ tyo e ilyuci i na a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i na̱ kari vu ucira a̱vu u la'a tsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />A̱vu a ama a̱ Yowab, na aza a Keretiya na aza a Feletiya a̱soja a na a yuwusan ipiri i mogono oɓolo na̱ a̱soja a na a gurai uvon suru a lyawa Urishelima, adama a saɓa Sheba ulobo wa Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Ana a rawai a aatali a gbain a̱tsuma̱ a Gibiyon, a̱vu Amasa ga'aton le. Yowab gba da̱na̱ ta̱ wotowu ni itana yu uvon ya̱ a̱yi, na̱ gbakala wunlu e ikyun ya̱ yi na̱ matsun me pe'eni a̱tsuma̱ e ibici ya̱ yi. Ana u zura̱i a rawa reve matsun me pe'eni'i mo foɗo e ibici ya̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />A̱vu Yowab damma Amasa, &lt;&lt;Imaci i va̱, cine vu ri?&gt;&gt; A̱vu u reme ntsuka̱ ma Amasa nu ukere u sa'ani wa̱ yi n gashi u ta katala yi. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Amasa gba wi indana na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma na ma̱ da̱na̱i o ukere wu ugula̱ wa Yowab shi. Ne ɗa Yowab sapai Amasa na̱ matsun me pe'eni hali itana ya̱ a̱tsuma̱ ya̱ yi yo oco e iɗa. Amasa kuwa̱ ta̱ babu Yowab sapa yi ire.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:10">A̱vu Yowab na̱ mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi Abishai a saɓa Sheba ulobo wa Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱soja a Yowab isawan ta̱ zuzu na̱ lipu va Amasa a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Suru za na ri o ucina̱ wa Yowab na̱ Da̱wuda, lyawa u toni Yowab!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Lipu va Amasa gba da̱na̱ ta̱ nven ulakatu na̱ mpasa e memere mo ure. Reve gba a na vuma'a we enei cine ama a̱ ta̱ra̱nusu e isawusan a̱ka̱nla̱, reve u tawa yi e memere mo ure'e a̱ tyo a atsusa, a̱vu wu pala yi nu umuna. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Ana vuma'a u tawai lipu va Amasa diga o ure, ama suru a̱ kuru ta̱ Yowab a saɓa Sheba ulobo wa Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba kuru ta̱ gundo va aza a Isra'ila suru a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci va Abel Bet Ma'aka na̱ o utula̱i upasu wa aza a Beri suru, aza a na o ɓolotoi reve a̱ kuru yi. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />A̱vu Yowab oɓolo na̱ a̱soja a̱ yi a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ Sheba a̱tsuma̱ a Abel Bet Ma'aka nu uvon. Reve o ɓolotowo ukari'i a̱jili una̱ta̱ nu uga'an wa̱ yi adama a kumba adama o uvon. Waru a̱soja Yowab suru a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ o mpolo wu uɓosu wu ukari u lyuci'i.<verse eid="2SA 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />A̱vu ka ro za vu ugbozu pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i u sala u damma, &lt;&lt;Uwai nda! Uwai nda! Dammai Yowab u ta̱wa̱, n ciga ta̱ n yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />A̱vu Yowab ta̱wa̱, a̱vu ka'a we ece yi, &lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗa Yowab?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">A̱vu usu yi, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">A̱vu ka'a u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu zuwa atsuvu vu uwwa ili i na aagbashi a̱ wu a damma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">A̱vu Yowab usu yi, &lt;&lt;N ta uwwusa wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />A̱vu ka'a u damma, &lt;&lt;Ɗe nu ujumu ama a tsu damma ta̱, &lt;A̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ lyuci va Abel adama a na a zamiyi a̱sa̱la̱ a sa'ani adama e ili i na yaa damatosun le.&gt; Ne ɗa waru adanshi'i u tsu koto. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Lyuci tsu lyuci gbain ɗa na a̱ ri a̱ nden lafiya na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila. Nye i zuwai vu cigai a na voo kototo yi? Nye i zuwai vu cigai vu ta'asa agadu a̱ A̱sulazuva?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />A̱vu Yowab usu u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a para a mu! Ko ke'en! Moo kototo yi ko n ta'asa lyuci ɗu shi! <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Ifoɓi i tsu i ɗa o ndolo'o shi. Vuma na a̱ tsu ɗe Sheba ulobo wa Bikiri diga e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu u 'ya̱sa̱a̱n ta̱ mogono Da̱wuda aci. Ta̱wa̱ na̱ vuma ta̱ nda'a, a̱mu gba n ta lyawa lyuci'i.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">A̱vu ka'a u damma Yowab, &lt;&lt;To, a ta variya wu aaci a̱yi nu ukari u lyuci'i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Reve ka'a u kuru ama a̱ lyuci'i suru na̱ a̱sa̱la̱ o ugbozu wa̱ yi, a̱vu o koɗo aaci a Sheba ulobo wa Bikiri reve a variya Yowab a̱yi. Ɗaɗa Yowab ivula̱i aavana, a̱vu a̱soja a̱yi e bete'we a lyawa lyuci'i, za suru ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi. Reve Yowab ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yowab ɗa da̱na̱i yali ya̱ a̱soja a Isra'ila suru. Benaya ulobo wa Jehoyida a̱yi ɗa u shi zagbain va̱ a̱soja aza a Keretiya na aza a Feletiya a̱za̱ e ipiri i mogono. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoniram ɗa za na ee idanasa a̱za̱ o ulinga u tsugbashi, Jehoshafa ulobo wa Ahilu a̱yi ɗa za na tsu ɗanasa ili i na i farai. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Shewa ɗa da̱na̱i za vi iɗana, Saduku na̱ Abiyata ɗa da̱na̱i nan ganu. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Ira vuma va Jayi da̱na̱ ta̱ ganu va Da̱wuda.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda tsupaa ta̱ aza a Gibiyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />A mantsa mo tsugono tsa̱ Da̱wuda a yuwan ta̱ ambulu a'wan a ta'atsu ukuruwula̱i, a̱vu Da̱wuda zami urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;Adama o wocosu wu mpasa ma Shawulu ɗa nu u'wa wa̱ yi a na wu unai aza a Gibiyon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Ama a Gibiyon aza a Isra'ila a ɗa shi, amma akapi a aza Amoriya a na a la'ai ɗa. Aza a Isra'ila a kucina ta̱ ɗe a ta lyawa le, amma Shawulu gba yuwan ta̱ mpolo n na wo o una le suru adama a̱ tsushu'un tsa a na u ri na̱ yi adama a ama a Isra'ila na̱ Yahuda. Reve mogono me ɗe aza a Gibiyon a̱vu u yuwan adanshi ne ele,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Jos 9:3-15.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />we ece e le, &lt;&lt;Nye maa yuwaan ɗu? Cine matara ume wu unusu adama e iwuya i na a yuwan n ɗu adama i zuwaa agadu a̱ A̱sulazuva aba'un?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />A̱vu aza a Gibiyon a̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;Amayun, azurufa ko zinariya aa gura foɓo tsu nu u'wa wa Shawulu shi, ko tse ece wuma wu nanza a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">A̱vu Da̱wuda ece ele, &lt;&lt;To, nye i cigai n yuwaan ɗu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />A̱vu a̱ usu mogono, &lt;&lt;Adama a vuma na una n tsu, waru u yuwain ifoɓi i na wo o kototo tsu, adama tsu tsura̱ tsu yuwan wuma a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Isra'ila suru wan, <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />lyawa a ca tsu muwun mo olobo n cindere a̱tsuma̱ a limatan va̱ yi, adama o una le, a̱vu tsu sa̱ga̱do lipu le zuva vu uɗanga a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a Gibiya lyuci va Shawulu mogono ma na A̱sulazuva a tawai.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Ɗaɗa mogono ma dammai, &lt;&lt;To, n ta ca ɗu ele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Amma a̱vu mogono ma lyawa Mefiboshe ulobo wa Jonata, mawun ma tsukaya ma Shawulu, adama a akucunu a na a̱ ri lo Da̱wuda na̱ Jonata ulobo wa Shawulu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 20:15-17; 2 Sam 9:1-7.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Amma mogono ma tara ta̱ Armoni na̱ vuma ro na a̱ shi tsu ɗe fo Mefiboshe olobo e re a Rizfa usheli wa A'iya, aza na u matsayin Shawulu, oɓolo no olobo o ton a Mera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mera </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aala a nda za ta̱ ɗa na̱ Mikal.</char></note> usheli wa Shawulu aza a na shi u matsayin Adriye ulobo wa Bazilai za va Mehola.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 18:19.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />A̱vu u ca le e ekere aza a Gibiyon, reve a̱ sa̱ga̱do le zuva vu uɗanga a masasan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Mecindere me le suru a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱ urana uta̱. O urana wu ufaru a mantsa ma na e temei ikani i yitabo.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />A̱vu Rizfa usheli wa A'iya, ka vu nge'en va Shawulu, ma tara akashamuna a̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu reve u foɓoo aciya̱yi uba̱ta̱ wu nden ɗe a aatali'i uba̱ta̱ u na a̱kwa̱kwa̱'a̱ a̱ ri. U da̱nu ta̱ lo uba̱ta̱'a̱ diga a mantsa ma na e temei ikani hali a cina mantsa ma̱lyuwushi ma na mini ma̱ cipa̱a̱ n le. Nu urana u tsu gba̱ra̱ ta̱ asala diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱'a̱, na ayin waru u tsu gba̱ra̱ ta̱ inama yu una diga uba̱ta̱ u le.<verse eid="2SA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />A mantsa ma na a dammai Da̱wuda ili i na Rizfa usheli wa A'iya ka vu nge'en va Shawulu yuwain, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />a̱vu Da̱wuda 'ya̱wa̱ u tara etele a Shawulu na̱ a̱za̱ o ulobo wa̱ yi Jonata diga uba̱ta̱ wa ama a Jabe Giliyadu. Amma ama a Jabe Giliyadu a̱ shi ta̱ e iva̱ lipu va Shawulu na̱ Jonata usokowu diga a agalaci a̱ lyuci va Bet Shan uba̱ta̱ u na aza a Filistiya a̱ shi a̱ sa̱ga̱do nle a na o unai Shawulu a masasan ma Gilbowa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 31:8-13.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Da̱wuda 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ne etele a Shawulu na̱ a̱za̱ o ulobo wa̱ yi Jonata diga ɗe, reve o ɓoloto etele a aza a na o unai na shi a̱ sa̱ga̱doi. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />A̱vu a̱ ciɗo etele a Shawulu na̱ a̱za̱ o ulobo wa̱ yi Jonata a aason a Kish dada va Shawulu a̱tsuma̱ Zela e iɗa ya Banyami, a̱vu a yuwan ili i na mogono ma zuwai suru. Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi A̱sula̱ a̱ usu ta̱ avasa e ele o una̱ we iɗa'a.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uvon na aza a Filistiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1 Alb 20:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Urana u ro aza a Filistiya a̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ aza a Isra'ila nu uvon. A̱vu Da̱wuda cipa̱ na̱ a̱soja a̱yi, reve a yuwan uvon na aza a Filistiya hali u kuna̱. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />A̱vu Isbi Beno vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a limatan va Rafa za na aaci e ibata yi rumushili va̱ yi rawai ume kilo o uta'atsu na akapi, za na waru shi wunlu na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma sa'avu, u damma u to o una Da̱wuda. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Amma a̱vu Abishai ulobo wa Zeruya ta̱wa̱a̱ Da̱wuda ni ikambishi. A̱vu u ga̱la̱ za va Filistiya'a, a̱vu wu una yi. Reve a̱soja'a a zuwa Da̱wuda a na waa kucinaa le, a na wa̱ da̱shi toni le a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ o uvon shi. Waru a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗa ucira wa aza a Isra'ila agba tsu ciga tsu lamba wu shi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Ngo 11:26; Ica 132:17.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />A mantsa mo ro waru a yuwan ta̱ uvon u ro na aza a Filistiya a Gob. A̱tsuma̱ o uvon u ɗaɗa Sibekai vuma va Husha unai Saf limatan va Rafa.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a yuwisan uvon u ro na aza a Filistiya a Gob, reve Elhanan ulobo wa Jayi za va Batalami una Goliya vuma va Gat, za na ugba̱mu wi ibata ya̱ yi u ta̱ tsu ushin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 17:50.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila'a a̱ da̱shi yuwisan uvon u ro waru a Gat. Vuma gbain ro shi ta̱ lo na akatsu a̱ ta̱li a̱ ta̱li o ukere na akatsu a̱ ta̱li a̱ ta̱li a ana, akatsu ushin na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi suru suru. A̱yi fo limatan va Rafa ɗa. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />A mantsa ma na u yuwaan yi aza a Isra'ila ulamu, a̱vu Jonata za na a̱yi ɗa ulobo wa Shimeya mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ Da̱wuda mo una yi.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />A̱soja a Filistiya a̱ na̱shi a nda limatan va Rafa ɗa shi diga a Gat, a̱vu a̱ kuwa̱ e ekere a̱ Da̱wuda na̱ a̱soja a̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Ishipa yi ica ya̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 18">Ica 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Da̱wuda canaa ta̱ A̱sulazuva ishipa i nda a mantsa ma na A̱sulazuva a wawa niyi e ekere a n'yuwatan ma̱ yi suru, na̱ diga e ekere Shawulu. <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />U damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ɗa aatali o upa'atan u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:2">ugeshete u va̱ na̱ za vi iwawi i va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱, a̱yi ɗa aatali o upa'atan u va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">Uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu u ɗa ma pa'asan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">A̱a̱ra̱ga̱ a̱ va̱, na̱ za vi iwawi yu ucira i va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">nu uɓaɓu wu ucira u va̱, nu ugeshete u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">za vi iwawi i va̱, za na tsu wawa mu e ekere a aza a na a̱ 'ya̱susa̱n ugbozu.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />N ta̱ ɗesu A̱sulazuva, za na rawai a na a yuwaan yi ica,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">waru u wawa mu ta̱ e ekere a n'yuwatan n va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />&lt;&lt;Adama a na ikeɗu i mini tsu ukwisa̱ a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">waru u shi ta̱ o soɗu mu na̱ meyene ma̱ mini ma̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Amunga o uba̱ta̱ wu nden wa̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ u ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ numu ta̱ kpakpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">maza mo ukwisa̱ waru ma̱ ta̱wa̱ mu ta̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ va̱ n ɗe ta̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">a̱vu n sala n ɗe a̱ tyo uba̱tu wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">A̱tsuma̱ o uba̱ta̱ wu nden wa̱ a̱yi ɗe zuva a̱vu wu uwwa uɗyo u va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">Ipati i va̱ a rawa ta̱ waru a atsuvu a̱yi.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />&lt;&lt;Uvaɗi u lumgbatsa ta̱ a̱vu u jinga̱ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">a̱vu ikyun yu usaa wa zuva u jinga̱ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">a̱ jinga̱ɗa̱ ta̱ lon adama a na u yuwain upan.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Mikyon mo uta̱ ta̱ diga a̱ vunu va̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">akina a malyuwa o uta̱ ta̱ diga o una̱ wa̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">akinkina a madala o uta̱ ta̱ diga 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />A̱vu u kpa̱tu'wa̱ zuva reve u cipa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">ne eleshe a̱ lima̱ da̱n za̱la̱ va̱ ana a̱yi.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Reve u kumba zuva nan kerobi a̱vu wu 'yawan zuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">u wala ta̱ o upepu wu ucira.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />A̱vu u ɓa̱ru aciya̱yi ni irumbu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">ne ɗa fo ne eleshe a̱ lima̱ a̱ mini ma zuva.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Diga a̱tsuma̱ e ekan i na i ri elime a̱yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">imaɗatsu yu uta̱i.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi tsa tsata diga zuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">a̱vu a uwwa uɗyo u Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱ diga zuva.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />A̱vu u tewin iliya ya̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">a̱vu u bete'we n'yuwatan ma̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">a̱vu u lyungu ni imaɗatsu i na i zuwa nle ilaɗi.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />A̱vu ikyun yu usaa yu uvaɗi yo o'wo a alanga eteshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">a̱vu mini ma mala mo o uta̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">na̱ tsuɓari tsa̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">a̱vu wivuwun wu ucira wu uta̱ diga a̱ vunu va̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Diga zuva A̱sulazuva a canana ta̱ ukere wa̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">reve u 'ya̱sa̱n mu zuva.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:17">Diga a̱ mini ma̱ a̱ru'un,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">u papa numu.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />A̱vu u wawa mu e ekere a n'yuwatan n va̱ mu ucira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">ne e ekere a aza a na a 'yuwan numu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">a na a la'a numu ucira.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />A̱ riya̱a̱ mu ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o urana wa̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">reve A̱sulazuva a kamba mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />A̱vu wu uta̱a̱ mu a̱ meleshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">u wawa mu adama a na u ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ a̱mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a tsupa mu ta̱ adama a̱ɓula̱ a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">u ca mu ta̱ iliyinkapa adama a na ekere a̱ va̱ a̱ri nu unusu shi.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Adama a na n yuwan ta̱ tsutoni nu ure wa̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">agba n lyawa A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a̱vu n yuwan iwiya shi.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />N yuwan ta̱ tsutoni na̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi suru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">agba n lyawa ili i na u zuwai a na a̱a̱ kuru shi.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />N da̱na̱ ta̱ babu unusu a̱ ma̱ka̱nka̱ ma̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">n tawa ta̱ aciya̱va̱ diga o ure u na maa yuwan unusu.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />A̱sulazuva a tsupa mu ta̱ adama a̱ɓula̱ a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">adama a na u reve ta̱ a̱mu za vu unusu ɗa shi e esu a̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva vu tsu roco ta̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere aza a na a̱ri na̱ a̱ɓula̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">Za na ri babu unusu, vu tsu roco ta̱ a̱vu za vu unusu ɗa shi.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Ee ekere a za na ri cece,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">vu tsu roco ta̱ aciya̱wu cece.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:27">Agba e ekere a za vi iwuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">vu tsu roco yi ta̱ tsushu'un.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Vu tsu wawa ta̱ aza a na a̱ ka̱ɗa̱toi aci e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">amma esu a̱ wu a̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a̱ri na aciyogbamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">adama vu ka̱ɗa̱to le.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗa ekan a̱ va̱, A̱sulazuva.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">A̱sulazuva a̱vu ɗa vi i ikanai irumbu i va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Adama a na ni ikambi ya̱ wu i ɗa ma̱ riya̱a̱ a̱soja o uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">ni ikambi ya̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a ɗa maa pasa ukari u lyuci.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />&lt;&lt;A̱sula̱ gba, re va̱ yi mejege ma ɗa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">Adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva waru amayun a ɗa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">A̱ra̱ga̱ a ɗa e ekere a aza na suru a zamiyi upa'atan ya̱'a̱ yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Udm 30:5.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Za ne ɗa A̱sula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">babu na̱ A̱sulazuva?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:32">Zane ɗa waru aatali o upa'atan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">babu na̱ a̱vu A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />A̱sula̱ a ɗa upa'atan wu ucira u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">waru u zuwa ta̱ re va̱ vo o'wo babu unusu.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />U zuwa ta̱ ana a̱ va̱ e reme iɗa tsa mere'on,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">a̱vu u zuwa mu mi isawan ciga̱ zuva vu nsasan.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />U rito ta̱ ekere a̱ va̱ a na aa yuwan uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">na̱ cine ekere a̱ va̱ aa gura ni'wa̱n utan wu rumushili.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />&lt;&lt;Agba vu ca mu ta̱ a̱a̱ra̱ga̱ a̱ wu za na wawa numu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">ikambi ya̱a̱ wu waru i zuwa mu ta̱ mo o'wo zagbain.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Vu lyawa n'yuwatan n va̱ n reme mu shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">agba n riya̱ a mantsa mo o uvon shi.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />M gbagba ta̱ n'yuwatan n va̱, a̱vu n kototo le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">mi isawan shi she na n lyuwai aci e le suru.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />N kototo le ta̱ suru suru, hali a̱ kuɗa̱ 'yon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">a̱vu a̱ riya̱ za̱la̱ va ana a̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Vu ca mu ta̱ ucira adama n yuwan uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">vu zuwa ta̱ n'yuwatan n va̱ za̱la̱ va ana a̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Agba vu zuwa ta̱ n'yuwatan n va̱ a vadala reve a sumaa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">a̱vu n kototo aza a na a 'yuwan numu.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Asala ta̱ adama a kamba le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">agba babu lo za na a wawa le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:42">a̱vu a salaa a̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">agba u usu le shi.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />N luɓa̱tsa̱ le ta̱, hali wo o tsa̱ ma̱buta̱ me iɗa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:43">a̱vu n kula̱ le, mu dasa le tso olo'o e re.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />&lt;&lt;Vu wawa mu ta̱ e ekere a ama e iwuya a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">vu shuwa̱ mu ta̱ mo o'wo zagbain vu nɗa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Ama a na n revei shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">o o'wo ta̱ agbashi a̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Omoci a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ elime a̱ va̱ na̱ meje'en ma̱ lipu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">a̱ kingyo a casu mu tsugbain,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:45">ele aa uwwa adama a ɗa a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">a tsu yuwaan mu ta̱ tsutoni.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Omocin a kuɗa ta̱ okolo le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">Na̱ meje'en ma̱ lipu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">ma ɗa a̱ tsu uta̱ diga uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ri upa'un.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva za na ri wuma ɗa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Ica a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa Aatali o upa'atan u va̱!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Tsugbain za va̱ A̱sula̱ ɗa, Aatali, zamawawa ma̱ a̱ va̱!<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />A̱sula̱ a ɗa a tsupaa numu aciya a n'yuwatan n va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">a̱yi ɗa u zuwai nɗa za̱la̱ tsugono tsa̱ a̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />A̱yi ɗa za na wawa numu e ekere a n'yuwatan n va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">U tsu ca mu ta̱ ulyuwu wa aci e ekere a aza a na a 'yuwan numu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">a̱vu u papa mu e ekere a ama a vama.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo n ta ca wu ica, a̱vu A̱sulazuva, a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">n ta cana ishipa yi ica a̱ tyo a ala a̱ wu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Rom 15:9.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />A̱yi atsura e iwawi i ɗa nu ulyuwu wa aci e ekere a̱ va̱ mogono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">u tsu roco ta̱ icigi i na i tsu vadala shi ekere a za na u tsuwa̱a̱n yi mani'in,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">a̱ tyo ya̱ Da̱wuda na̱ limatan va̱ yi hali hali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Adanshi o ukosu wi ishipa ya̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Apa nda a adanshi o ukosu wi ishipa ya̱ Da̱wuda a na u ɗanai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">&lt;&lt;Ikaka ya̱ Da̱wuda ulobo wa̱ Yese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">ikaka i vuma na Mogono ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma cayi tsugbain,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">vuma na A̱sula̱ a Yakubu a̱ tsuwa̱a̱n yi mani'in a na wo o mogono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">ma̱dobiya me ishipa yu uyo'o ma Isra'ila.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />&lt;&lt;Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva yuwan ta̱ adanshi o una̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:2">adanshi a̱yi a̱ ta̱ e elentsu a̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila a yuwan ta̱ adanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Aatali o upa'atan wa Isra'ila a damma mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">&lt;Mantsa ma na vuma ri a yuwusan tsugbain tsa ama a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">na̱ waa yuwusan tsugbain a̱tsuma̱ o wovon wa̱ A̱sula̱,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />u ta̱ tse ekan yu urana a̱ mota̱a̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">tse ekan yu usana babu eleshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">tse ekan a mantsa ma na o kotoi iro'i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">na tsu zuwa anlya o uta̱ e iɗa.&gt;<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />&lt;&lt;Na amayun, u'wa u va̱ u ri na aba'un A̱sula̱ shi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Adama a na u yuwaan mu ta̱ akucunu a na a̱ ri nu ukosu shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">ekere e ili biti na̱ mapari uba̱ta̱ suru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Na amayun ili i ro yi lo shi u ta zuwa mu n tsura̱ ulyuwu we elime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">reve waru u ca mu ili i na n cigai suru.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Amma a ama a vama suru a tawa le ta̱ tsa̱a̱ awanda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">aza a na a̱ tsu ɓoloto ne e ekere shi.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Amma suru za na a̱ ju'wa̱n awanda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">u tsu yuwan ta̱ ulinga na̱ sheburu ko ibata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">a̱ tsu kula̱to le ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ri nven.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱soja a̱ Da̱wuda a na a la'a gurai uvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:10-25">1 Alb 11:10-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Apa ala a nan a̱soja a̱ Da̱wuda a na a la'a gurai uvon, Yoshe Bashebe vuma va Takemon, a̱yi ɗa u shi yali ya̱ a̱soja a ta'atsu, u 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ ibata ya̱ yi wu una ama ukpakukunla̱ (800) a mantsa ma̱ ta̱.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Za va ire a̱tsuma̱ a na nan yali ya̱ a̱soja a ta'atsu o ndolo a̱yi ɗa Eliyaza ulobo wa̱ Dodo va Ahohi. U da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ Da̱wuda a̱tsuma̱ aza a na a yuwusan yi aza a Filistiya ulamu a mantsa ma na o ɓolotoi a̱tsuma̱ a Pas Damim adama o uvon. A̱vu ama a Isra'ila a suma. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Amma wi isawan ta̱ nu ukadu a̱vu wu ga̱la̱ aza a Filistiya hali she na ukere wa̱ yi u kaɓai a matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi. A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ nu ulyuwu wa aci lon o urana u ndolo. Oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a Isra'ila a vadala ta̱ a̱ tyo ya Eliyaza, adama a̱ pura̱ itana ya a aza na o unai.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Za va ta'atsu a̱tsuma̱ a na nan yali ya̱ a̱soja a ta'atsu o ndolo a̱yi ɗa Shama ulobo wa Age vuma va Harari. Mantsa ma na aza a Filistiya o ɓolotoi uba̱ta̱ uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci va Lehi o uɗuma̱ u na u ri na aluba e nre'on, a̱vu a̱soja a Isra'ila a sumaa le. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Amma Shama isawan ta̱ nu ukadu o uɗuma̱'a̱. U geshe yi ta̱ a̱vu wu una aza a Filistiya. A̱sulazuva gba a ca le ta̱ ulyuwu wa aci u gbain.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Urana u ro a mantsa me ikani, ama a ta'atsu diga a̱tsuma̱ a̱soja mata'atsu a̱ Da̱wuda a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ba̱nu a Adulam. Oɓolo a̱soja aza a Filistiya a gba a̱ va̱la̱ ta̱ o Uka̱ri wa aza a Refaya. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />A mantsa mo ndolo Da̱wuda da̱na̱ ta̱ pe uba̱ta̱ o upa'atan. Oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a Filistiya waru a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ ɗe Batalami. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />A̱vu Da̱wuda uwwa akuli a̱ mini a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;O'o, a damma nanza ta̱ tsura̱a̱ mu mini mo oso diga o oko'o a na a̱ ri zuzu nu una̱ntsu wa Batalami!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu a̱soja a ta'atsu o ndolo a ɓatsa a̱tsuma̱ o oɓolo a̱soja a Filistiya. A̱vu e kene mini a̱tsuma̱ o oko'o a na a̱ ri zuzu nu una̱ntsu wa Batalami a̱vu a tanu yi e tewe Da̱wuda. Amma a̱vu u 'yuwan o sowo mini'i, a̱vu wo oco yi e iɗa tsa̱ kucci e ekere A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />A̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a paraa mu a na mo sowo ili yaa nda! Mpasa ma aza a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i o una̱ u meleshe u wuma u le u ɗa shi?&gt;&gt; Adama o ndolo a̱vu Da̱wuda 'yuwan o sowo mini'i.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Ili i ndolo ɗa a̱soja a ta'atsu o ndolo a yuwain.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abishai gba mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma Yowab za na mma le ɗa Zeruya, ɗa da̱na̱i yali ya̱ a̱soja mata'atsu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mata'atsu pa nda: Yiɗanishi i ro yu ukere yu ufaru a̱ ta̱ na̱ &lt;&lt;mata'atsu&gt;&gt; </char></note> U ya̱sa̱n ta̱ ibata ya̱ yi a̱vu wu una a̱soja ukpakuta'atsu (300). Adama o ndolo a̱vu e reve na̱ a̱yi tsa ama a ta'atsu o ndolo. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />U la'a ta̱ ama a ta'atsu o ndolo tsugbain. A̱vu wo o'wo yali i le, ko na o ɓolo niyi a̱tsuma̱ e le shi.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaya ulobo wa Jehoyida vuma ɗa na gurai uvon lon diga a̱ lyuci va Kabuzeye, u yuwan ta̱ linga gbagbain. Wu una ta̱ ama a Mowa ejere aza a na a gurai uvon lon. Urana u ro a mantsa mo uta̱nu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a mantsa mo uta̱nu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na̱ Tsuyahuda oroci e iro'i i ɗa i na i tsi riya̱ tsa atayan.</char></note> a̱vu u cipa̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri o ro wu una kamu. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Wu una ta̱ vuma ro va Masar na da̱na̱i mgbain. Agba vuma va Masar'm u da̱na̱ ta̱ uɓa̱nu ni ibata o ukere wa̱ yi. Amma Benaya zura̱ yi ta̱ na aɗanga. A̱vu u usa ibata'a o ukere u vuma va Masar'm a̱vu wu una yi na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Ele nda ele ɗa ili i na Benaya ulobo wa Jehoyida yuwain, a̱yi fo e reve ta̱ na̱ a̱yi tsa nan yali ya̱ a̱soja a ta'atsu o ndolo. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />U tsura̱ ta̱ tsugbain tsa na tsa la'ai a̱soja mata'atsu o ndolo, ko na o ɓolo niyi a̱tsuma̱ a̱soja a ta'atsu'u shi. A̱vu Da̱wuda zuwa yi wo o'wo zagbain va̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri ya̱ yi.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱soja mata'atsu a̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:26-41">1 Alb 11:26-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Ama a nda a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱soja mata'atsu a̱ Da̱wuda:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Asahe mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ Yowab</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">na̱ Elhanan ulobo wa̱ Dodo va Batalami<verse eid="2SA 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />na̱ Shama va Haro</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:25">na̱ Elika va Haro<verse eid="2SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />na̱ Helez va Palti</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:26">na̱ Ira ulobo wa Ikesh va Tekowa<verse eid="2SA 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />na̱ Abiyeza va Anato</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:27">na̱ Mebunai va Husha<verse eid="2SA 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />na̱ Zalumo va Ahohi</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:28">na̱ Maharai va Netofa<verse eid="2SA 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />na̱ Hele ulobo wa Ba'ana va Netofa</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:29">na̱ Itai ulobo wa Ribai za va Gibiya a̱tsuma̱ o gundo wa Banyami<verse eid="2SA 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />na̱ Benaya va Piraton</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:30">na̱ Hidai na uta̱i diga a̱ ka̱ri va Ga'ash<verse eid="2SA 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />na̱ Abiyalbon va Arba</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:31">na̱ Azimawe va Bahurim<verse eid="2SA 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32-33" />na̱ Eliyabu va Sha'albon</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32-33">na̱ olobo a Yashen</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32-33">na̱ Jonata ulobo wa Shama va Harari</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32-33">na̱ Ahiya ulobo wa Shara va Harari<verse eid="2SA 23:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />na̱ Elifele ulobo wa Ahasbai va Ma'aka</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:34">na̱ Eliyam ulobo wa Ahitofe va̱ Gilo<verse eid="2SA 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />na̱ Hezro va Kame</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:35">na̱ Pa'arai va Arba<verse eid="2SA 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />na̱ Iga ulobo wa Natan va̱ Zoba</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:36">na̱ Bani va Gadu<verse eid="2SA 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />na̱ Zele va Amon</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:37">na̱ Naharai va Biyaro, za na tsu guzusa̱a̱ Yowab ulobo wa Zeruya itana yu uvon<verse eid="2SA 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />na̱ Ira na̱ Gare ama a Itiri<verse eid="2SA 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />na̱ Uriya vuma va Hitiya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:39" />
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:39">Ele nda ele ɗa a̱soja mata'atsu na̱ a̱za̱ e cindere suru suru.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda kece ta̱ a̱soja a̱yi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 21:1-17">1 Alb 21:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱shi yuwan upan na aza a Isra'ila lon, hali u linga na̱ Da̱wuda adama u ta̱wa̱a̱ le na addama, u damma, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ adama vu kece ama a Isra'ila na̱ aza a Yahuda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />A̱vu mogono ma damma Yowab yali ya̱ a̱soja a̱yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo o gundo va aza a Isra'ila suru, diga upasu wu ugana u lyuci wa Dan a̱ tyo upasu wu uyagi u lyuci wa Biyasheba. A̱vu vu kece suru aza a na a rawai yuwan uvon, n ciga ta̱ n reve a̱bunda̱ e le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Amma Yowab usu ta̱ mogono, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a̱ da̱shi o oɓolo a̱za̱ o uvon ukpaku udoɓonuwu, waru lyawa esu a zagbain va̱ mogono ene. Amma nye i zuwai zagbain va̱ mogono maa cigai ma yuwan cu'un vi ili i nda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Suru na̱ ne adanshi o mogono ma la'a ta̱ za va Yowab na̱ a̱soja o uvon. Adama o ndolo a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a lyawa mogono adama e kece suru aza a na a rawai yuwain uvon a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Ana a pasai Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ zuzu na̱ Arowa, uyagi na̱ lyuci o ukari'i. Diga lo a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo upasu wa Gadu a cina lyuci va Jaza. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />A̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Giliyadu na̱ iɗa ya Tatim Hodshi, a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ tyo a̱ lyuci va Dan Ja'an a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ a cina upasu wa Sidon. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />A̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo e ilyuci ya Taya i na i ri uka̱nda̱ruwu nu ukari ni ilyuci ya aza a Hiviya na aza a Ka'ana suru. O ukosu waru, a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Biyasheba a̱tsuma̱ o upasu we Nege va Yahuda.<verse eid="2SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Ana a̱ kuruyi iɗa'a suru, a̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima o ukosu u woto u kuci na̱ rana ushin.<verse eid="2SA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />A̱vu Yowab damma mogono a̱bunda̱ a̱ a̱soja'a. A̱tsuma̱ a aza a Isra'ila a rawa ta̱ ukpakukupa ukpaku kunla̱ (800,000), aza a na aa gura ɓana matsun me pe'eni ulobonu, a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda waru ukpakukupa ukpaku uton (500,000).<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Reve ili'i i ka̱ra̱ a damatosun Da̱wuda lon a mantsa ma na o kotoi mekece ma aza a na a rawai yuwain uvo'on, a̱vu okolo a̱yi a̱ la̱nga̱. A̱vu u damma A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;N yuwan ta̱ unusu lon adama a na n yuwain mekece ma nda. Gogo gba, A̱sulazuva, n te ipati ya̱ wu, vu yuwaan aagbashi a̱ wu gafura. Adama a na n yuwan ta̱ tsulo lon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Kafu Da̱wuda 'yon nu usana, A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Gadu vumava̱sula̱, za na a yuwusaan Da̱wuda yindi, ana, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱ vu damma Da̱wuda, &lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, n ta ca su wu aɗangulu a ta'atsu. Ɗangula za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ oforo a nda, waru n ta yuwain aci a̱ wu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />A̱vu Gadu ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu ciga ta̱ a yuwan ambulu a'wan a ta'atsu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya̱ wu? Ko waru n'yuwatan ma̱ wu n da̱na̱ a saɓusa wu reve vu da̱na̱ e ilaɗi elime hali woto ta'atsu? Ko gba shi vu ciga ta̱ a yuwan mɓa̱la̱ rana ta'atsu e iɗa ya̱ wu? Gogo vu yuwan majiyan ma̱ yi, a̱vu vu ca mu u'usuwu u na ma̱a̱ usu wa̱ A̱sulazuva za na lyungu numu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />A̱vu Da̱wuda usu Gadu, &lt;&lt;N uwa ta̱ uta'atsu. Lyawa tsu riya̱ e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, adama a na iliyali ya̱ yi i ta̱ mgbain. Amma she vu lyawa mu n riya̱ e ekere a ama a wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ lyunguwa̱a̱ aza a Isra'ila na̱ mɓa̱la̱ a cina ukosu u mantsa ma na a zuwai, a̱vu ama ukpakukupa kupocindere (70,000) diga upasu wu ugana u lyuci wa Dan a̱ tyo upasu wu uyagi u lyuci wa Biyasheba a̱ kuwa̱. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />A mantsa ma na malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱ da̱na̱i e ifoɓi i na woo kototo Urishelima, reve A̱sulazuva a vadala okolo a̱yi a̱vu u damma malingata mo kototosu'u, &lt;&lt;U rawa ta̱! Vu tawa ukere wa̱ wu!&gt;&gt; A mantsa mo ndolo malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva'a ma̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ lo osoroto Aruna vuma va Jebusiya.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />A mantsa ma na Da̱wuda enei malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma na ma̱ ri o ukototosu wa ama'a, a̱vu u damma A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa za na yuwain ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ nu unusu. Ele ama a nda a ta̱ cine vu revei ikyon. Nye i ɗa a yuwain? Lyawa ukere wa̱ wu u cipa̱ e ekere va̱ nu u'wa u va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda suwa ta̱ masa'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 21:18-27">1 Alb 21:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />A̱tsuma̱ o uranu u ndolo a̱vu Gadu ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo ya̱ Da̱wuda a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu ka̱ra̱ a gawan adama vu suwaa A̱sulazuva masa'a osoroto Aruna vuma va Jebusiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />A̱vu Da̱wuda ka̱ra̱ a gawan, cine A̱sulazuva a dammai o una̱ wa Gadu. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Ana Aruna ka̱lyuwa̱i a̱vu we ene mogono na azagbain a̱yi a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ yi, a̱vu wu uta̱ u kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi a̱ tyo e iɗa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n mo mogono.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />A̱vu Aruna damma, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i tarai zagbain va̱ mogono a na wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa aagbashi a̱ yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">A̱vu Da̱wuda usu yi, &lt;&lt;N ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama n tsula osoroto a̱ wu adama n suwaa A̱sulazuva masa'a, adama a tawa mɓa̱la̱ n na n ri e ekere a ama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />A̱vu Aruna damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Lyawa zagbain va̱ mogono ma tara suru ili i na i lobono niyi u ca kucci na̱ a̱yi. Apa nda ogono e inan adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, apa nda waru aɗanga na ma fabusa ishina na̱ adama a ɗanga kucci. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Mogono, a̱mu n ca wu ta̱ suru ili i nda.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Aruna da̱shi damma yi, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a̱ ushi wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Amma a̱vu mogono ma̱ usu yi u damma, &lt;&lt;O'o, n ta tsupa wu. Maa ca A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu za na n kuɗa̱i o una ili i ro shi.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Da̱wuda tsula osoroto'o oɓolo no ogono e ina'an ni ikebe i azurufa kupoton. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Reve Da̱wuda suwaa A̱sulazuva masa'a lo, a̱vu u ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ kucci muwwulai. Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ usu avasa o una̱ wi iɗa'a, ɗaɗa a tawayi Isra'ila mɓa̱la'a̱.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>